    "After AppSense activates a profile, switch to your chosen profile when the focused app isn’t linked to any enabled profile. Profiles selected manually aren’t affected." : {
      "comment" : "Settings control description\nSettings search description",
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "After AppSense activates a profile, switch to your chosen profile when the focused app isn’t linked to any enabled profile. Profiles selected manually aren’t affected."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "بعد أن يفعّل AppSense ملف تعريف، يتم التبديل إلى ملف التعريف الذي تختاره عندما لا يكون التطبيق النشط مرتبطًا بأي ملف تعريف مفعّل. لا تتأثر ملفات التعريف المحددة يدويًا."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "After AppSense activates a profile, switch to your chosen profile when the focused app isn’t linked to any enabled profile. Profiles selected manually aren’t affected."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "After AppSense activates a profile, switch to your chosen profile when the focused app isn’t linked to any enabled profile. Profiles selected manually aren’t affected."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "After AppSense activates a profile, switch to your chosen profile when the focused app isn’t linked to any enabled profile. Profiles selected manually aren’t affected."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nachdem AppSense ein Profil aktiviert hat, zu Ihrem gewählten Profil wechseln, wenn die fokussierte App mit keinem aktivierten Profil verknüpft ist. Manuell ausgewählte Profile sind nicht betroffen."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "After AppSense activates a profile, switch to your chosen profile when the focused app isn’t linked to any enabled profile. Profiles selected manually aren’t affected."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Después de que AppSense active un perfil, cambia al perfil que elijas cuando la app en primer plano no esté enlazada a ningún perfil activado. Los perfiles seleccionados manualmente no se ven afectados."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "After AppSense activates a profile, switch to your chosen profile when the focused app isn’t linked to any enabled profile. Profiles selected manually aren’t affected."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Après qu'AppSense a activé un profil, basculer vers le profil de votre choix lorsque l'app au premier plan n'est liée à aucun profil activé. Les profils sélectionnés manuellement ne sont pas concernés."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "After AppSense activates a profile, switch to your chosen profile when the focused app isn’t linked to any enabled profile. Profiles selected manually aren’t affected."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Miután az AppSense aktivált egy profilt, a kiválasztott profilra vált, ha a fókuszban lévő app egyetlen engedélyezett profilhoz sincs kapcsolva. A kézzel kiválasztott profilokat ez nem érinti."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "After AppSense activates a profile, switch to your chosen profile when the focused app isn’t linked to any enabled profile. Profiles selected manually aren’t affected."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AppSenseがプロファイルをアクティブにしたあと、フォーカス中のアプリがどの有効なプロファイルにもリンクされていない場合に、選択したプロファイルに切り替えます。手動で選択したプロファイルには影響しません。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "After AppSense activates a profile, switch to your chosen profile when the focused app isn’t linked to any enabled profile. Profiles selected manually aren’t affected."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "After AppSense activates a profile, switch to your chosen profile when the focused app isn’t linked to any enabled profile. Profiles selected manually aren’t affected."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nadat AppSense een profiel heeft geactiveerd, schakel je over naar het door jou gekozen profiel wanneer de actieve app niet aan een ingeschakeld profiel is gekoppeld. Handmatig geselecteerde profielen worden hierdoor niet beïnvloed."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Po aktywowaniu profilu przez AppSense przełącz na wybrany profil, gdy aktywna aplikacja nie jest powiązana z żadnym włączonym profilem. Nie ma to wpływu na profile wybrane ręcznie."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Depois de o AppSense ativar um perfil, mudar para o perfil escolhido quando a app em foco não está associada a nenhum perfil ativado. Os perfis selecionados manualmente não são afetados."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "After AppSense activates a profile, switch to your chosen profile when the focused app isn’t linked to any enabled profile. Profiles selected manually aren’t affected."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "After AppSense activates a profile, switch to your chosen profile when the focused app isn’t linked to any enabled profile. Profiles selected manually aren’t affected."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "После того как AppSense активирует профиль, переключаться на выбранный профиль, когда активное приложение не связано ни с одним включенным профилем. Профили, выбранные вручную, не затрагиваются."
          }
        },
        "sr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "After AppSense activates a profile, switch to your chosen profile when the focused app isn’t linked to any enabled profile. Profiles selected manually aren’t affected."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "När AppSense har aktiverat en profil byts det till den profil du valt när appen i fokus inte är länkad till någon aktiverad profil. Profiler som valts manuellt påverkas inte."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AppSense bir profili etkinleştirdikten sonra, odaktaki uygulama etkin hiçbir profille bağlantılı değilse seçtiğin profile geç. Elle seçilen profiller etkilenmez."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "After AppSense activates a profile, switch to your chosen profile when the focused app isn’t linked to any enabled profile. Profiles selected manually aren’t affected."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sau khi AppSense kích hoạt một hồ sơ, hệ thống sẽ chuyển sang hồ sơ bạn đã chọn nếu ứng dụng đang hoạt động không được liên kết với bất kỳ hồ sơ nào đã bật. Các hồ sơ được chọn thủ công sẽ không bị ảnh hưởng."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AppSense 激活配置文件后，当焦点应用未关联到任何已启用的配置文件时，自动切换到你选择的配置文件。手动选择的配置文件不受影响。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AppSense 啟用設定檔後，當目前聚焦的應用程式未連結至任何已啟用的設定檔時，自動切換至你選擇的設定檔。手動選取的設定檔不受影響。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
