    "Also hide when a window covers everything below the menu bar, like a maximized video player. True fullscreen apps always hide the dock. Not used while Avoid Dock Overlap is on, since that resizes the window instead." : {
      "comment" : "Settings control description",
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Also hide when a window covers everything below the menu bar, like a maximized video player. True fullscreen apps always hide the dock. Not used while Avoid Dock Overlap is on, since that resizes the window instead."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "الإخفاء أيضًا عندما تغطي نافذة كل ما تحت شريط القائمة، مثل مشغل فيديو مكبّر. التطبيقات في وضع ملء الشاشة الحقيقي تخفي Dock دائمًا. لا يُستخدم أثناء تشغيل «تجنب تداخل Dock»، لأنه يغيّر حجم النافذة بدلًا من ذلك."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Also hide when a window covers everything below the menu bar, like a maximized video player. True fullscreen apps always hide the dock. Not used while Avoid Dock Overlap is on, since that resizes the window instead."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Also hide when a window covers everything below the menu bar, like a maximized video player. True fullscreen apps always hide the dock. Not used while Avoid Dock Overlap is on, since that resizes the window instead."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Also hide when a window covers everything below the menu bar, like a maximized video player. True fullscreen apps always hide the dock. Not used while Avoid Dock Overlap is on, since that resizes the window instead."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Auch ausblenden, wenn ein Fenster alles unterhalb der Menüleiste bedeckt, etwa ein maximierter Videoplayer. Echte Vollbild-Apps blenden das Dock immer aus. Wird nicht verwendet, solange „Dock-Überlappung vermeiden“ aktiv ist, da dann stattdessen die Fenstergröße angepasst wird."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Also hide when a window covers everything below the menu bar, like a maximized video player. True fullscreen apps always hide the dock. Not used while Avoid Dock Overlap is on, since that resizes the window instead."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Oculta también el Dock cuando una ventana cubre todo lo que hay debajo de la barra de menús, como un reproductor de vídeo maximizado. Las apps en pantalla completa real siempre ocultan el Dock. No se usa mientras Evitar solapamiento con el Dock está activado, ya que en ese caso se redimensiona la ventana."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Also hide when a window covers everything below the menu bar, like a maximized video player. True fullscreen apps always hide the dock. Not used while Avoid Dock Overlap is on, since that resizes the window instead."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Masquer aussi lorsqu'une fenêtre couvre tout l'espace sous la barre des menus, comme un lecteur vidéo maximisé. Les apps réellement en plein écran masquent toujours le dock. Inutilisé lorsque Éviter les chevauchements de dock est activé, car cette option redimensionne alors la fenêtre."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Also hide when a window covers everything below the menu bar, like a maximized video player. True fullscreen apps always hide the dock. Not used while Avoid Dock Overlap is on, since that resizes the window instead."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Akkor is elrejti, ha egy ablak a menüsor alatti teljes területet lefedi, például egy teljes méretűre nagyított videolejátszó. A valódi teljes képernyős appok mindig elrejtik a Dockot. Nem használatos, amíg a Dock-átfedés elkerülése be van kapcsolva, mert az ilyenkor inkább átméretezi az ablakot."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Also hide when a window covers everything below the menu bar, like a maximized video player. True fullscreen apps always hide the dock. Not used while Avoid Dock Overlap is on, since that resizes the window instead."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最大化したビデオプレーヤーのように、ウインドウがメニューバーより下を完全に覆っている場合にも隠します。本当のフルスクリーンのアプリでは常にDockが隠れます。「Dockとの重なりを回避」がオンの場合は、代わりにウインドウのサイズが変更されるため使用されません。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Also hide when a window covers everything below the menu bar, like a maximized video player. True fullscreen apps always hide the dock. Not used while Avoid Dock Overlap is on, since that resizes the window instead."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Also hide when a window covers everything below the menu bar, like a maximized video player. True fullscreen apps always hide the dock. Not used while Avoid Dock Overlap is on, since that resizes the window instead."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Verberg het Dock ook wanneer een venster alles onder de menubalk bedekt, zoals een gemaximaliseerde videospeler. Echte volledig-scherm-apps verbergen het Dock altijd. Deze optie wordt niet gebruikt wanneer ‘Vermijd overlapping van Dock’ is ingeschakeld, omdat daarmee de grootte van het venster wordt aangepast."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ukrywaj Dock także wtedy, gdy okno zasłania wszystko poniżej paska menu, na przykład zmaksymalizowany odtwarzacz wideo. Aplikacje działające w trybie pełnoekranowym zawsze ukrywają Dock. Ustawienie nie jest używane, gdy włączona jest opcja Unikaj nakładania się z Dockiem, ponieważ zamiast tego zmienia ona rozmiar okna."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ocultar também quando uma janela cobre tudo abaixo da barra de menus, como um leitor de vídeo maximizado. As apps em ecrã completo ocultam sempre a Dock. Não é usado enquanto Evitar Sobreposição da Dock estiver ativo, pois essa opção redimensiona a janela."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Also hide when a window covers everything below the menu bar, like a maximized video player. True fullscreen apps always hide the dock. Not used while Avoid Dock Overlap is on, since that resizes the window instead."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Also hide when a window covers everything below the menu bar, like a maximized video player. True fullscreen apps always hide the dock. Not used while Avoid Dock Overlap is on, since that resizes the window instead."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Также скрывать, когда окно занимает все пространство под строкой меню, например развернутый видеоплеер. Приложения в настоящем полноэкранном режиме всегда скрывают Dock. Не действует, когда включен параметр «Избегать перекрытия Dock», так как он изменяет размер окна."
          }
        },
        "sr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Also hide when a window covers everything below the menu bar, like a maximized video player. True fullscreen apps always hide the dock. Not used while Avoid Dock Overlap is on, since that resizes the window instead."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Göm även när ett fönster täcker allt under menyraden, till exempel en maximerad videospelare. Appar i äkta helskärmsläge gömmer alltid dockan. Används inte när Undvik docköverlappning är på, eftersom fönstret då ändrar storlek i stället."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bir pencere menü çubuğunun altındaki her şeyi kapladığında da gizle, örneğin büyütülmüş bir video oynatıcı gibi. Gerçek tam ekran uygulamalar dock'u her zaman gizler. Pencereyi bunun yerine yeniden boyutlandırdığı için Dock Çakışmasını Önle açıkken kullanılmaz."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Also hide when a window covers everything below the menu bar, like a maximized video player. True fullscreen apps always hide the dock. Not used while Avoid Dock Overlap is on, since that resizes the window instead."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cũng ẩn khi có cửa sổ che toàn bộ không gian bên dưới thanh menu, chẳng hạn như trình phát video được phóng to. Các ứng dụng toàn màn hình thực sự luôn làm ẩn Dock. Không được sử dụng khi tính năng Tránh chồng lấn dock đang bật, vì tính năng đó sẽ thay đổi kích thước cửa sổ thay vì ẩn."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当窗口覆盖菜单栏下方的整个屏幕时（例如最大化的视频播放器），也隐藏 Dock。真正处于全屏模式的应用始终会隐藏 Dock。启用“避免 Dock 重叠”时，此选项不生效，因为该功能会改为调整窗口大小。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此外，當視窗覆蓋選單列下方的整個畫面時也會隱藏 Dock，例如最大化的影片播放器。真正的全螢幕 App 一律會隱藏 Dock。啟用「避免與 Dock 重疊」時不適用，因為該功能會改為調整視窗大小。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Also surface minimized windows from apps that already have a dock icon, not just menu bar and background apps. These tiles can duplicate an app's own icon." : {
      "comment" : "Settings control description",
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Also surface minimized windows from apps that already have a dock icon, not just menu bar and background apps. These tiles can duplicate an app's own icon."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "أظهر أيضًا النوافذ المصغّرة من التطبيقات التي لها أيقونة في Dock بالفعل، وليس فقط تطبيقات شريط القائمة والخلفية. قد تكرر هذه المربعات أيقونة التطبيق نفسه."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Also surface minimized windows from apps that already have a dock icon, not just menu bar and background apps. These tiles can duplicate an app's own icon."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Also surface minimized windows from apps that already have a dock icon, not just menu bar and background apps. These tiles can duplicate an app's own icon."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Also surface minimized windows from apps that already have a dock icon, not just menu bar and background apps. These tiles can duplicate an app's own icon."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Auch minimierte Fenster von Apps anzeigen, die bereits ein Dock-Symbol haben, nicht nur Menüleisten- und Hintergrund-Apps. Diese Kacheln können das eigene Symbol einer App duplizieren."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Also surface minimized windows from apps that already have a dock icon, not just menu bar and background apps. These tiles can duplicate an app's own icon."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Muestra también ventanas minimizadas de apps que ya tienen un icono en el Dock, no solo de apps de la barra de menús y en segundo plano. Estas fichas pueden duplicar el icono propio de una app."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Also surface minimized windows from apps that already have a dock icon, not just menu bar and background apps. These tiles can duplicate an app's own icon."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Afficher aussi les fenêtres réduites des apps qui ont déjà une icône dans le dock, pas seulement celles des apps de barre des menus et d'arrière-plan. Ces vignettes peuvent faire doublon avec l'icône de l'app."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Also surface minimized windows from apps that already have a dock icon, not just menu bar and background apps. These tiles can duplicate an app's own icon."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A már Dock-ikonnal rendelkező appok kicsinyített ablakait is megjeleníti, nem csak a menüsori és háttérappokét. Ezek a csempék megkettőzhetik az app saját ikonját."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Also surface minimized windows from apps that already have a dock icon, not just menu bar and background apps. These tiles can duplicate an app's own icon."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "メニューバーアプリやバックグラウンドアプリだけでなく、すでにDockアイコンがあるアプリのしまわれたウインドウも表示します。これらのタイルはアプリ自体のアイコンと重複することがあります。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Also surface minimized windows from apps that already have a dock icon, not just menu bar and background apps. These tiles can duplicate an app's own icon."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Also surface minimized windows from apps that already have a dock icon, not just menu bar and background apps. These tiles can duplicate an app's own icon."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Toon ook geminimaliseerde vensters van apps die al een Dock-pictogram hebben, niet alleen apps in de menubalk en op de achtergrond. Deze tegels kunnen het eigen pictogram van een app dupliceren."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pokazuj też zminimalizowane okna aplikacji, które mają już ikonę w Docku, nie tylko aplikacji z paska menu i działających w tle. Te kafelki mogą powielać własną ikonę aplikacji."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mostrar também janelas minimizadas de aplicações que já têm um ícone na Dock, não apenas de aplicações da barra de menus e em segundo plano. Estes mosaicos podem duplicar o próprio ícone de uma aplicação."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Also surface minimized windows from apps that already have a dock icon, not just menu bar and background apps. These tiles can duplicate an app's own icon."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Also surface minimized windows from apps that already have a dock icon, not just menu bar and background apps. These tiles can duplicate an app's own icon."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Отображать свернутые окна приложений, у которых уже есть значок в Dock (а не только окна фоновых приложений или программ, представленных лишь в строке меню). Эти миниатюры могут дублировать собственный значок приложения."
          }
        },
        "sr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Also surface minimized windows from apps that already have a dock icon, not just menu bar and background apps. These tiles can duplicate an app's own icon."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Visa även minimerade fönster från appar som redan har en docksymbol, inte bara menyrads- och bakgrundsappar. Dessa rutor kan dubblera en apps egen symbol."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Yalnızca menü çubuğu ve arka plan uygulamalarının değil, zaten dock simgesi olan uygulamaların simge durumuna küçültülmüş pencerelerini de göster. Bu kutucuklar uygulamanın kendi simgesini yineleyebilir."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Also surface minimized windows from apps that already have a dock icon, not just menu bar and background apps. These tiles can duplicate an app's own icon."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Đồng thời hiển thị cả các cửa sổ đã thu nhỏ của những ứng dụng đã có biểu tượng trên Dock, thay vì chỉ các ứng dụng trên thanh menu và ứng dụng chạy nền. Các ô này có thể trùng với biểu tượng Dock của chính ứng dụng đó."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "除了菜单栏应用和后台应用外，也会显示已在 Dock 中的应用的最小化窗口。这些窗口可能会与应用本身的 Dock 图标同时显示。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "也顯示已有 Dock 圖示之應用程式的最小化視窗，而不僅限於選單列應用程式和背景應用程式。這些圖塊可能會與應用程式本身的 Dock 圖示重複。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
