    "Beta builds arrive before stable releases and may be less reliable. Switching back to Stable keeps the current build until the next stable release." : {
      "comment" : "Settings control description",
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Beta builds arrive before stable releases and may be less reliable. Switching back to Stable keeps the current build until the next stable release."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تصل إصدارات بيتا قبل الإصدارات المستقرة وقد تكون أقل موثوقية. عند العودة إلى «مستقر» يبقى الإصدار الحالي حتى الإصدار المستقر التالي."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Beta builds arrive before stable releases and may be less reliable. Switching back to Stable keeps the current build until the next stable release."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Beta builds arrive before stable releases and may be less reliable. Switching back to Stable keeps the current build until the next stable release."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Beta builds arrive before stable releases and may be less reliable. Switching back to Stable keeps the current build until the next stable release."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Beta-Builds erscheinen vor stabilen Versionen und können weniger zuverlässig sein. Beim Zurückwechseln zu „Stabil“ bleibt der aktuelle Build bis zur nächsten stabilen Version erhalten."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Beta builds arrive before stable releases and may be less reliable. Switching back to Stable keeps the current build until the next stable release."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las versiones beta llegan antes que las versiones estables y pueden ser menos fiables. Si vuelves a Estable, se mantiene la versión actual hasta la siguiente versión estable."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Beta builds arrive before stable releases and may be less reliable. Switching back to Stable keeps the current build until the next stable release."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les versions bêta arrivent avant les versions stables et peuvent être moins fiables. En revenant à Stable, vous conservez la version actuelle jusqu'à la prochaine version stable."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Beta builds arrive before stable releases and may be less reliable. Switching back to Stable keeps the current build until the next stable release."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A béta buildek a stabil kiadások előtt érkeznek, és kevésbé megbízhatók lehetnek. A Stabil csatornára való visszaváltáskor a jelenlegi build a következő stabil kiadásig megmarad."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Beta builds arrive before stable releases and may be less reliable. Switching back to Stable keeps the current build until the next stable release."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ベータ版のビルドは安定版より先に配信されますが、信頼性が低い場合があります。「安定版」に戻しても、次の安定版がリリースされるまでは現在のビルドが維持されます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Beta builds arrive before stable releases and may be less reliable. Switching back to Stable keeps the current build until the next stable release."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Beta builds arrive before stable releases and may be less reliable. Switching back to Stable keeps the current build until the next stable release."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bètaversies verschijnen vóór de stabiele releases en zijn mogelijk minder betrouwbaar. Als je terugschakelt naar ‘Stabiel’, behoud je de huidige versie tot de volgende stabiele release."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wersje beta pojawiają się przed wydaniami stabilnymi i mogą być mniej niezawodne. Po powrocie do kanału stabilnego bieżąca wersja pozostanie zainstalowana do czasu następnego stabilnego wydania."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "As versões beta chegam antes das versões estáveis e podem ser menos fiáveis. Voltar para Estável mantém a versão atual até à próxima versão estável."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Beta builds arrive before stable releases and may be less reliable. Switching back to Stable keeps the current build until the next stable release."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Beta builds arrive before stable releases and may be less reliable. Switching back to Stable keeps the current build until the next stable release."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Бета-сборки выходят раньше стабильных выпусков и могут быть менее надежными. При возврате на канал «Стабильный» текущая сборка сохраняется до следующего стабильного выпуска."
          }
        },
        "sr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Beta builds arrive before stable releases and may be less reliable. Switching back to Stable keeps the current build until the next stable release."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Betaversioner kommer före stabila versioner och kan vara mindre tillförlitliga. Om du byter tillbaka till Stabil behålls den aktuella versionen tills nästa stabila version släpps."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Beta sürümleri kararlı sürümlerden önce gelir ve daha az güvenilir olabilir. Kararlı sürüme geri dönmek, bir sonraki kararlı sürüme kadar mevcut derlemeyi korur."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Beta builds arrive before stable releases and may be less reliable. Switching back to Stable keeps the current build until the next stable release."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Các bản dựng beta ra mắt trước các bản phát hành ổn định và có thể kém tin cậy hơn. Chuyển lại sang Ổn định sẽ giữ bản dựng hiện tại cho đến bản phát hành ổn định tiếp theo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "测试版会先于稳定版发布，可靠性可能较低。切换回稳定版后，将保留当前版本，直到下一个稳定版发布。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Beta 版本會在正式版本之前發布，且穩定性可能較低。切換回正式版本後，將會保留目前的版本，直到下一個正式版本發布為止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
