    "Calendar and Daily Agenda read your events. Reminders reads and completes reminders. Quick Contacts reads the people you pick. Recent Photos reads your photo library. Weather uses your location. Voice Memo and Microphone Mute use the microphone. App Volume captures per-app audio to adjust it. Quick Toggles switches Bluetooth." : {
      "comment" : "Setup permission preflight explanation",
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Calendar and Daily Agenda read your events. Reminders reads and completes reminders. Quick Contacts reads the people you pick. Recent Photos reads your photo library. Weather uses your location. Voice Memo and Microphone Mute use the microphone. App Volume captures per-app audio to adjust it. Quick Toggles switches Bluetooth."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تقرأ أداتا «التقويم» و«جدول اليوم» أحداثك. تقرأ «التذكيرات» التذكيرات وتُكملها. تقرأ «جهات الاتصال السريعة» الأشخاص الذين تختارهم. تقرأ «الصور الأخيرة» مكتبة صورك. يستخدم «الطقس» موقعك. تستخدم «مذكرة صوتية» و«كتم الميكروفون» الميكروفون. يلتقط «مستوى صوت التطبيقات» صوت كل تطبيق لضبطه. تبدّل «مفاتيح التبديل السريعة» حالة Bluetooth."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Calendar and Daily Agenda read your events. Reminders reads and completes reminders. Quick Contacts reads the people you pick. Recent Photos reads your photo library. Weather uses your location. Voice Memo and Microphone Mute use the microphone. App Volume captures per-app audio to adjust it. Quick Toggles switches Bluetooth."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Calendar and Daily Agenda read your events. Reminders reads and completes reminders. Quick Contacts reads the people you pick. Recent Photos reads your photo library. Weather uses your location. Voice Memo and Microphone Mute use the microphone. App Volume captures per-app audio to adjust it. Quick Toggles switches Bluetooth."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Calendar and Daily Agenda read your events. Reminders reads and completes reminders. Quick Contacts reads the people you pick. Recent Photos reads your photo library. Weather uses your location. Voice Memo and Microphone Mute use the microphone. App Volume captures per-app audio to adjust it. Quick Toggles switches Bluetooth."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kalender und Tagesübersicht lesen Ihre Termine. Erinnerungen liest und erledigt Erinnerungen. Schnellkontakte liest die von Ihnen gewählten Personen. Neueste Fotos liest Ihre Fotomediathek. Wetter verwendet Ihren Standort. Sprachmemo und Mikrofon stumm verwenden das Mikrofon. App-Lautstärke nimmt das Audio einzelner Apps auf, um es anzupassen. Schnellschalter schaltet Bluetooth um."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Calendar and Daily Agenda read your events. Reminders reads and completes reminders. Quick Contacts reads the people you pick. Recent Photos reads your photo library. Weather uses your location. Voice Memo and Microphone Mute use the microphone. App Volume captures per-app audio to adjust it. Quick Toggles switches Bluetooth."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Calendario y Agenda diaria leen tus eventos. Recordatorios lee y completa recordatorios. Contactos rápidos lee las personas que elijas. Fotos recientes lee tu fototeca. Tiempo usa tu ubicación. Nota de voz y Silenciar micrófono usan el micrófono. Volumen de apps captura el audio de cada app para ajustarlo. Controles rápidos activa y desactiva el Bluetooth."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Calendar and Daily Agenda read your events. Reminders reads and completes reminders. Quick Contacts reads the people you pick. Recent Photos reads your photo library. Weather uses your location. Voice Memo and Microphone Mute use the microphone. App Volume captures per-app audio to adjust it. Quick Toggles switches Bluetooth."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Calendrier et Agenda quotidien lisent vos événements. Rappels lit et coche les rappels. Contacts rapides lit les personnes que vous choisissez. Photos récentes lit votre photothèque. Météo utilise votre position. Mémo vocal et Couper le micro utilisent le micro. Volume des apps capture l'audio de chaque app pour l'ajuster. Commandes rapides active ou désactive le Bluetooth."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Calendar and Daily Agenda read your events. Reminders reads and completes reminders. Quick Contacts reads the people you pick. Recent Photos reads your photo library. Weather uses your location. Voice Memo and Microphone Mute use the microphone. App Volume captures per-app audio to adjust it. Quick Toggles switches Bluetooth."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A Naptár és a Napi program olvassa az eseményeket. Az Emlékeztetők olvassa és teljesíti az emlékeztetőket. A Gyors kontaktok a kiválasztott személyeket olvassa. A Legutóbbi fotók a fotókönyvtárat olvassa. Az Időjárás a tartózkodási helyet használja. A Hangjegyzet és a Mikrofonnémítás a mikrofont használja. Az Apphangerő appenként rögzíti a hangot a beállításhoz. A Gyorskapcsolók a Bluetootht kapcsolják."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Calendar and Daily Agenda read your events. Reminders reads and completes reminders. Quick Contacts reads the people you pick. Recent Photos reads your photo library. Weather uses your location. Voice Memo and Microphone Mute use the microphone. App Volume captures per-app audio to adjust it. Quick Toggles switches Bluetooth."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「カレンダー」と「今日の予定」はイベントを読み取ります。「リマインダー」はリマインダーを読み取って完了にします。「クイック連絡先」は選択した人を読み取ります。「最近の写真」は写真ライブラリを読み取ります。「天気」は位置情報を使用します。「ボイスメモ」と「マイクのミュート」はマイクを使用します。「アプリ音量」は音量を調整するためにアプリごとのオーディオをキャプチャします。「クイックトグル」はBluetoothを切り替えます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Calendar and Daily Agenda read your events. Reminders reads and completes reminders. Quick Contacts reads the people you pick. Recent Photos reads your photo library. Weather uses your location. Voice Memo and Microphone Mute use the microphone. App Volume captures per-app audio to adjust it. Quick Toggles switches Bluetooth."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Calendar and Daily Agenda read your events. Reminders reads and completes reminders. Quick Contacts reads the people you pick. Recent Photos reads your photo library. Weather uses your location. Voice Memo and Microphone Mute use the microphone. App Volume captures per-app audio to adjust it. Quick Toggles switches Bluetooth."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "'Agenda' en 'Dagprogramma' lezen je activiteiten. 'Herinneringen' leest en voltooit herinneringen. 'Snelle contacten' leest de personen die je kiest. ‘Recente foto's’ leest je fotobibliotheek. 'Weer' gebruikt je locatie. 'Spraakmemo' en 'Microfoon dempen' gebruiken de microfoon. 'App volume' neemt het geluid per app op om het aan te passen. 'Snelle schakelaars' schakelt Bluetooth in of uit."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kalendarz i Plan dnia odczytują wydarzenia. Przypomnienia odczytują przypomnienia i oznaczają je jako wykonane. Szybkie kontakty odczytują wybrane osoby. Ostatnie zdjęcia odczytują bibliotekę zdjęć. Pogoda korzysta z Twojego położenia. Notatka głosowa i Wyciszanie mikrofonu korzystają z mikrofonu. Głośność aplikacji przechwytuje dźwięk poszczególnych aplikacji, aby regulować jego głośność. Szybkie przełączniki włączają i wyłączają Bluetooth."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Calendário e Agenda Diária leem os seus eventos. Lembretes lê e conclui lembretes. Contactos Rápidos lê as pessoas que escolher. Fotografias Recentes lê a sua fototeca. Meteorologia usa a sua localização. Memo de Voz e Silenciar Microfone usam o microfone. Volume das Apps captura o áudio de cada app para o ajustar. Interruptores Rápidos ativa e desativa o Bluetooth."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Calendar and Daily Agenda read your events. Reminders reads and completes reminders. Quick Contacts reads the people you pick. Recent Photos reads your photo library. Weather uses your location. Voice Memo and Microphone Mute use the microphone. App Volume captures per-app audio to adjust it. Quick Toggles switches Bluetooth."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Calendar and Daily Agenda read your events. Reminders reads and completes reminders. Quick Contacts reads the people you pick. Recent Photos reads your photo library. Weather uses your location. Voice Memo and Microphone Mute use the microphone. App Volume captures per-app audio to adjust it. Quick Toggles switches Bluetooth."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Виджеты «Календарь» и «Повестка дня» читают ваши события. «Напоминания» читают и отмечают выполненные напоминания. «Быстрые контакты» читают выбранных вами людей. «Недавние фото» читают вашу медиатеку. «Погода» использует вашу геопозицию. «Голосовая заметка» и «Выключение микрофона» используют микрофон. «Громкость приложений» захватывает звук каждого приложения, чтобы регулировать его. «Быстрые переключатели» включают и выключают Bluetooth."
          }
        },
        "sr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Calendar and Daily Agenda read your events. Reminders reads and completes reminders. Quick Contacts reads the people you pick. Recent Photos reads your photo library. Weather uses your location. Voice Memo and Microphone Mute use the microphone. App Volume captures per-app audio to adjust it. Quick Toggles switches Bluetooth."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kalender och Dagens agenda läser dina händelser. Påminnelser läser och bockar av påminnelser. Snabbkontakter läser de personer du väljer. Senaste bilder läser ditt bildbibliotek. Väder använder din plats. Röstmemo och Mikrofon av använder mikrofonen. Appvolym fångar ljud per app för att justera det. Snabbreglage växlar Bluetooth."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Takvim ve Günlük Gündem etkinliklerini okur. Anımsatıcılar, anımsatıcıları okur ve tamamlar. Hızlı Kişiler seçtiğin kişileri okur. Son Fotoğraflar fotoğraf kitaplığını okur. Hava Durumu konumunu kullanır. Sesli Not ve Mikrofon Sessize Alma mikrofonu kullanır. Uygulama Sesi, ayarlamak için uygulama başına sesi yakalar. Hızlı Geçişler Bluetooth'u açıp kapatır."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Calendar and Daily Agenda read your events. Reminders reads and completes reminders. Quick Contacts reads the people you pick. Recent Photos reads your photo library. Weather uses your location. Voice Memo and Microphone Mute use the microphone. App Volume captures per-app audio to adjust it. Quick Toggles switches Bluetooth."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lịch và Chương trình trong ngày đọc các sự kiện của bạn. Lời nhắc đọc và hoàn thành lời nhắc. Liên hệ nhanh đọc những người bạn chọn. Ảnh gần đây đọc thư viện ảnh của bạn. Thời tiết sử dụng vị trí của bạn. Ghi âm và Tắt tiếng micrô sử dụng micrô. Âm lượng ứng dụng ghi lại âm thanh của từng ứng dụng để điều chỉnh. Bật/tắt nhanh chuyển đổi Bluetooth."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“日历”和“今日议程”读取您的日程。“提醒事项”读取提醒事项并将其标记为完成。“快捷联系人”读取您选择的联系人。“最近照片”读取您的照片图库。“天气”使用您的位置。“语音备忘录”和“麦克风静音”使用麦克风。“应用音量”采集各应用的音频以调整音量。“快捷开关”控制蓝牙开关。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「行事曆」和「今日行程」會讀取你的行程。「提醒事項」會讀取並將提醒事項標示為完成。「快速聯絡人」會讀取你所選取的聯絡人。「最近的照片」會讀取你的照片圖庫。「天氣」會使用你的位置資訊。「語音備忘錄」和「麥克風靜音」會使用麥克風。「應用程式音量」會擷取各應用程式的音訊，以調整個別應用程式的音量。「快速切換」會切換藍牙。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
