    "Click the Trash to open Finder's Trash, which also shows items trashed from external drives and other volumes." : {
      "comment" : "Settings search description",
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Click the Trash to open Finder's Trash, which also shows items trashed from external drives and other volumes."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "انقر على المهملات لفتح سلة مهملات Finder، والتي تعرض أيضًا العناصر المحذوفة من الأقراص الخارجية ووحدات التخزين الأخرى."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Click the Trash to open Finder's Trash, which also shows items trashed from external drives and other volumes."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Click the Trash to open Finder's Trash, which also shows items trashed from external drives and other volumes."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Click the Trash to open Finder's Trash, which also shows items trashed from external drives and other volumes."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Klicken Sie auf den Papierkorb, um den Papierkorb des Finder zu öffnen, der auch Objekte von externen Laufwerken und anderen Volumes anzeigt."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Click the Trash to open Finder's Trash, which also shows items trashed from external drives and other volumes."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Haz clic en la Papelera para abrir la Papelera del Finder, que también muestra los ítems eliminados de discos externos y otros volúmenes."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Click the Trash to open Finder's Trash, which also shows items trashed from external drives and other volumes."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cliquez sur la Corbeille pour ouvrir la Corbeille du Finder, qui affiche aussi les éléments supprimés depuis des disques externes et d'autres volumes."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Click the Trash to open Finder's Trash, which also shows items trashed from external drives and other volumes."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A Kukára kattintva a Finder Kukája nyílik meg, amely a külső meghajtókról és más kötetekről a Kukába helyezett elemeket is mutatja."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Click the Trash to open Finder's Trash, which also shows items trashed from external drives and other volumes."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ゴミ箱をクリックするとFinderのゴミ箱が開き、外部ドライブやその他のボリュームからゴミ箱に入れた項目も表示されます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Click the Trash to open Finder's Trash, which also shows items trashed from external drives and other volumes."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Click the Trash to open Finder's Trash, which also shows items trashed from external drives and other volumes."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Klik op de prullenmand om de prullenmand van Finder te openen, die ook items toont die van externe schijven en andere volumes zijn weggegooid."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kliknij Kosz, aby otworzyć Kosz Findera, który pokazuje także rzeczy usunięte z dysków zewnętrznych i innych woluminów."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Clique no Lixo para abrir o Lixo do Finder, que também mostra os itens enviados para o Lixo a partir de discos externos e outros volumes."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Click the Trash to open Finder's Trash, which also shows items trashed from external drives and other volumes."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Click the Trash to open Finder's Trash, which also shows items trashed from external drives and other volumes."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Нажатие на Корзину открывает Корзину Finder, где также видны объекты, удаленные с внешних дисков и других томов."
          }
        },
        "sr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Click the Trash to open Finder's Trash, which also shows items trashed from external drives and other volumes."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Klicka på papperskorgen för att öppna papperskorgen i Finder, som även visar objekt som slängts från externa enheter och andra volymer."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Harici sürücülerden ve diğer birimlerden çöpe atılan öğeleri de gösteren Finder'ın Çöp Sepeti'ni açmak için Çöp Sepeti'ne tıkla."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Click the Trash to open Finder's Trash, which also shows items trashed from external drives and other volumes."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nhấp vào Thùng rác để mở Thùng rác của Finder, nơi cũng hiển thị các mục bị xóa từ ổ đĩa ngoài và các ổ đĩa khác."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "点击废纸篓以打开访达中的废纸篓，其中也会显示从外置驱动器和其他宗卷移入的项目。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按一下「垃圾桶」即可開啟 Finder 的「垃圾桶」，其中也會顯示從外接硬碟及其他卷宗刪除的項目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click the Trash to open Finder's Trash, which also shows items trashed from external drives and other volumes. Applies when Finder is the file manager." : {
      "comment" : "Settings control description",
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Click the Trash to open Finder's Trash, which also shows items trashed from external drives and other volumes. Applies when Finder is the file manager."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "انقر على المهملات لفتح سلة مهملات Finder، والتي تعرض أيضًا العناصر المحذوفة من الأقراص الخارجية ووحدات التخزين الأخرى. ينطبق عندما يكون Finder هو مدير الملفات."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Click the Trash to open Finder's Trash, which also shows items trashed from external drives and other volumes. Applies when Finder is the file manager."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Click the Trash to open Finder's Trash, which also shows items trashed from external drives and other volumes. Applies when Finder is the file manager."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Click the Trash to open Finder's Trash, which also shows items trashed from external drives and other volumes. Applies when Finder is the file manager."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Klicken Sie auf den Papierkorb, um den Papierkorb des Finder zu öffnen, der auch Objekte von externen Laufwerken und anderen Volumes anzeigt. Gilt, wenn der Finder der Dateimanager ist."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Click the Trash to open Finder's Trash, which also shows items trashed from external drives and other volumes. Applies when Finder is the file manager."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Haz clic en la Papelera para abrir la Papelera del Finder, que también muestra los ítems eliminados de discos externos y otros volúmenes. Se aplica cuando el Finder es el gestor de archivos."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Click the Trash to open Finder's Trash, which also shows items trashed from external drives and other volumes. Applies when Finder is the file manager."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cliquez sur la Corbeille pour ouvrir la Corbeille du Finder, qui affiche aussi les éléments supprimés depuis des disques externes et d'autres volumes. S'applique lorsque le Finder est le gestionnaire de fichiers."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Click the Trash to open Finder's Trash, which also shows items trashed from external drives and other volumes. Applies when Finder is the file manager."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A Kukára kattintva a Finder Kukája nyílik meg, amely a külső meghajtókról és más kötetekről a Kukába helyezett elemeket is mutatja. Akkor érvényes, ha a Finder a fájlkezelő."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Click the Trash to open Finder's Trash, which also shows items trashed from external drives and other volumes. Applies when Finder is the file manager."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ゴミ箱をクリックするとFinderのゴミ箱が開き、外部ドライブやその他のボリュームからゴミ箱に入れた項目も表示されます。Finderがファイルマネージャの場合に適用されます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Click the Trash to open Finder's Trash, which also shows items trashed from external drives and other volumes. Applies when Finder is the file manager."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Click the Trash to open Finder's Trash, which also shows items trashed from external drives and other volumes. Applies when Finder is the file manager."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Klik op de prullenmand om de prullenmand van Finder te openen, die ook items toont die van externe schijven en andere volumes zijn weggegooid. Geldt wanneer Finder de bestandsbeheerder is."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kliknij Kosz, aby otworzyć Kosz Findera, który pokazuje także rzeczy usunięte z dysków zewnętrznych i innych woluminów. Dotyczy sytuacji, gdy Finder jest menedżerem plików."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Clique no Lixo para abrir o Lixo do Finder, que também mostra os itens enviados para o Lixo a partir de discos externos e outros volumes. Aplica-se quando o Finder é o gestor de ficheiros."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Click the Trash to open Finder's Trash, which also shows items trashed from external drives and other volumes. Applies when Finder is the file manager."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Click the Trash to open Finder's Trash, which also shows items trashed from external drives and other volumes. Applies when Finder is the file manager."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Нажатие на Корзину открывает Корзину Finder, где также видны объекты, удаленные с внешних дисков и других томов. Действует, если файловым менеджером выбран Finder."
          }
        },
        "sr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Click the Trash to open Finder's Trash, which also shows items trashed from external drives and other volumes. Applies when Finder is the file manager."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Klicka på papperskorgen för att öppna papperskorgen i Finder, som även visar objekt som slängts från externa enheter och andra volymer. Gäller när Finder är filhanterare."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Harici sürücülerden ve diğer birimlerden çöpe atılan öğeleri de gösteren Finder'ın Çöp Sepeti'ni açmak için Çöp Sepeti'ne tıkla. Finder dosya yöneticisi olduğunda geçerlidir."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Click the Trash to open Finder's Trash, which also shows items trashed from external drives and other volumes. Applies when Finder is the file manager."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nhấp vào Thùng rác để mở Thùng rác của Finder, nơi cũng hiển thị các mục bị xóa từ ổ đĩa ngoài và các ổ đĩa khác. Áp dụng khi Finder là trình quản lý tệp."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "点击废纸篓以打开访达中的废纸篓，其中也会显示从外置驱动器和其他宗卷移入的项目。使用访达作为文件管理器时适用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按一下「垃圾桶」即可開啟 Finder 的「垃圾桶」，其中也會顯示從外接硬碟及其他卷宗刪除的項目。僅在使用 Finder 作為檔案管理工具時套用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
