            "value" : "DockDoor Pro heeft aparte zones voor profielen, widgets, apps, de prullenmand en bestanden. Elke zone scrollt of reageert op een andere manier."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DockDoor Pro ma osobne obszary dla profili, widżetów, aplikacji, Kosza i plików. Każdy obszar przewija się lub reaguje inaczej."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O DockDoor Pro tem regiões separadas para perfis, widgets, apps, Lixo e ficheiros. Cada região desloca-se ou reage de forma diferente."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "DockDoor Pro has separate regions for profiles, widgets, apps, Trash, and files. Each region scrolls or reacts differently."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "DockDoor Pro has separate regions for profiles, widgets, apps, Trash, and files. Each region scrolls or reacts differently."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DockDoor Pro имеет отдельные области для профилей, виджетов, приложений, Корзины и файлов. Каждая область прокручивается или реагирует по-своему."
          }
        },
        "sr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "DockDoor Pro has separate regions for profiles, widgets, apps, Trash, and files. Each region scrolls or reacts differently."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DockDoor Pro har separata områden för profiler, widgetar, appar, papperskorgen och filer. Varje område rullar eller reagerar på sitt eget sätt."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DockDoor Pro'da profiller, widget'lar, uygulamalar, Çöp Sepeti ve dosyalar için ayrı bölgeler vardır. Her bölge farklı kaydırılır veya tepki verir."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "DockDoor Pro has separate regions for profiles, widgets, apps, Trash, and files. Each region scrolls or reacts differently."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DockDoor Pro có các vùng riêng biệt cho hồ sơ, tiện ích, ứng dụng, Thùng rác và tệp. Mỗi vùng sẽ cuộn hoặc phản hồi theo cách khác nhau."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DockDoor Pro 将 Dock 划分为配置文件、小组件、应用、废纸篓和文件等独立区域。每个区域都拥有各自的滚动和交互方式。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DockDoor Pro 將 Dock 劃分為設定檔、小工具、應用程式、垃圾桶與檔案等獨立區域。各區域可擁有不同的捲動方式與互動行為。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DockDoor Pro needs access to show chosen folder contents, move files you dragged, and keep staged tray items useful. The Recent Files widget reads your Downloads folder and the Screenshots widget reads your Desktop." : {
      "comment" : "Setup permission preflight explanation",
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "DockDoor Pro needs access to show chosen folder contents, move files you dragged, and keep staged tray items useful. The Recent Files widget reads your Downloads folder and the Screenshots widget reads your Desktop."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "يحتاج DockDoor Pro إلى الوصول لعرض محتويات المجلدات المختارة، ونقل الملفات التي سحبتها، والحفاظ على فائدة العناصر المجهّزة في الحاوية. تقرأ أداة «الملفات الأخيرة» مجلد التنزيلات، وتقرأ أداة «لقطات الشاشة» سطح المكتب."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "DockDoor Pro needs access to show chosen folder contents, move files you dragged, and keep staged tray items useful. The Recent Files widget reads your Downloads folder and the Screenshots widget reads your Desktop."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "DockDoor Pro needs access to show chosen folder contents, move files you dragged, and keep staged tray items useful. The Recent Files widget reads your Downloads folder and the Screenshots widget reads your Desktop."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "DockDoor Pro needs access to show chosen folder contents, move files you dragged, and keep staged tray items useful. The Recent Files widget reads your Downloads folder and the Screenshots widget reads your Desktop."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DockDoor Pro benötigt Zugriff, um den Inhalt ausgewählter Ordner anzuzeigen, von Ihnen gezogene Dateien zu bewegen und bereitgestellte Objekte in der Ablage nutzbar zu halten. Das Widget „Letzte Dateien“ liest Ihren Ordner „Downloads“ und das Widget „Bildschirmfotos“ liest Ihren Schreibtisch."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "DockDoor Pro needs access to show chosen folder contents, move files you dragged, and keep staged tray items useful. The Recent Files widget reads your Downloads folder and the Screenshots widget reads your Desktop."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DockDoor Pro necesita acceso para mostrar el contenido de las carpetas elegidas, mover los archivos que arrastres y mantener útiles los ítems preparados en la bandeja. El widget Archivos recientes lee tu carpeta Descargas y el widget Capturas de pantalla lee tu Escritorio."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "DockDoor Pro needs access to show chosen folder contents, move files you dragged, and keep staged tray items useful. The Recent Files widget reads your Downloads folder and the Screenshots widget reads your Desktop."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DockDoor Pro a besoin d'un accès pour afficher le contenu des dossiers choisis, déplacer les fichiers que vous avez glissés et garder utiles les éléments placés dans le tiroir. Le widget Fichiers récents lit votre dossier Téléchargements et le widget Captures d'écran lit votre Bureau."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "DockDoor Pro needs access to show chosen folder contents, move files you dragged, and keep staged tray items useful. The Recent Files widget reads your Downloads folder and the Screenshots widget reads your Desktop."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A DockDoor Pro-nak hozzáférésre van szüksége a kiválasztott mappák tartalmának megjelenítéséhez, a behúzott fájlok áthelyezéséhez és a tálcán előkészített elemek használhatóságának megőrzéséhez. A Legutóbbi fájlok widget a Letöltések mappát, a Képernyőfotók widget pedig az Íróasztalt olvassa."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "DockDoor Pro needs access to show chosen folder contents, move files you dragged, and keep staged tray items useful. The Recent Files widget reads your Downloads folder and the Screenshots widget reads your Desktop."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DockDoor Proは、選択したフォルダの内容を表示したり、ドラッグしたファイルを移動したり、トレイに置いた項目を使える状態に保ったりするためにアクセスを必要とします。「最近使ったファイル」ウィジェットは「ダウンロード」フォルダを、「スクリーンショット」ウィジェットはデスクトップを読み取ります。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "DockDoor Pro needs access to show chosen folder contents, move files you dragged, and keep staged tray items useful. The Recent Files widget reads your Downloads folder and the Screenshots widget reads your Desktop."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "DockDoor Pro needs access to show chosen folder contents, move files you dragged, and keep staged tray items useful. The Recent Files widget reads your Downloads folder and the Screenshots widget reads your Desktop."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DockDoor Pro heeft toegang nodig om de inhoud van gekozen mappen te tonen, bestanden die je hebt gesleept te verplaatsen en items in het bestandsvak bruikbaar te houden. De widget 'Recente bestanden' leest je map Downloads en de widget 'Screenshots' leest je bureaublad."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DockDoor Pro potrzebuje dostępu, aby wyświetlać zawartość wybranych folderów, przenosić przeciągnięte pliki i umożliwiać korzystanie z elementów na Półce plików. Widżet Ostatnie pliki odczytuje folder Pobrane rzeczy, a widżet Zrzuty ekranu odczytuje Biurko."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O DockDoor Pro precisa de acesso para mostrar o conteúdo das pastas escolhidas, mover os ficheiros que arrastou e manter úteis os itens preparados no tabuleiro. O widget Ficheiros Recentes lê a pasta Descargas e o widget Capturas de Ecrã lê a Secretária."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "DockDoor Pro needs access to show chosen folder contents, move files you dragged, and keep staged tray items useful. The Recent Files widget reads your Downloads folder and the Screenshots widget reads your Desktop."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "DockDoor Pro needs access to show chosen folder contents, move files you dragged, and keep staged tray items useful. The Recent Files widget reads your Downloads folder and the Screenshots widget reads your Desktop."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DockDoor Pro нужен доступ, чтобы показывать содержимое выбранных папок, перемещать перетащенные вами файлы и сохранять работоспособность объектов в лотке. Виджет «Недавние файлы» читает папку «Загрузки», а виджет «Снимки экрана» читает Рабочий стол."
          }
        },
        "sr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "DockDoor Pro needs access to show chosen folder contents, move files you dragged, and keep staged tray items useful. The Recent Files widget reads your Downloads folder and the Screenshots widget reads your Desktop."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DockDoor Pro behöver åtkomst för att visa innehållet i valda mappar, flytta filer som du har dragit och hålla objekt i filbrickan användbara. Widgeten Senaste filer läser mappen Hämtade filer och widgeten Skärmavbildningar läser ditt skrivbord."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DockDoor Pro'nun seçilen klasör içeriklerini göstermek, sürüklediğin dosyaları taşımak ve hazırlanan tepsi öğelerini kullanışlı tutmak için erişime ihtiyacı var. Son Dosyalar widget'ı İndirilenler klasörünü, Ekran Görüntüleri widget'ı ise Masaüstü'nü okur."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "DockDoor Pro needs access to show chosen folder contents, move files you dragged, and keep staged tray items useful. The Recent Files widget reads your Downloads folder and the Screenshots widget reads your Desktop."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DockDoor Pro cần quyền truy cập để hiển thị nội dung thư mục đã chọn, di chuyển các tệp bạn đã kéo và giữ cho các mục trong khay luôn hữu ích. Tiện ích Tệp gần đây đọc thư mục Tải về của bạn và tiện ích Ảnh chụp màn hình đọc Màn hình nền của bạn."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DockDoor Pro 需要访问权限，以显示所选文件夹的内容、移动您拖入的文件，并让文件托盘中的暂存项目保持可用。“最近文件”小组件会读取“下载”文件夹，“截屏”小组件会读取“桌面”文件夹。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DockDoor Pro 需要取用權限，才能顯示所選檔案夾的內容、移動你拖曳的檔案，並讓檔案托盤中暫存的項目保持可用。「最近使用的檔案」小工具會讀取你的「下載項目」檔案夾，而「螢幕截圖」小工具則會讀取你的「桌面」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
