    "Finder handles Trash and reveal actions you choose. The Mail and Latest Note widgets read your unread count and most recent note, and the Quick Toggles and Wallpaper widgets use System Events to switch Dark Mode and change the desktop picture. Each app is asked about separately, the first time a widget needs it." : {
      "comment" : "Setup permission preflight explanation",
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Finder handles Trash and reveal actions you choose. The Mail and Latest Note widgets read your unread count and most recent note, and the Quick Toggles and Wallpaper widgets use System Events to switch Dark Mode and change the desktop picture. Each app is asked about separately, the first time a widget needs it."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "يتولى Finder إجراءات المهملات والإظهار التي تختارها. تقرأ أداتا «البريد» و«أحدث ملاحظة» عدد الرسائل غير المقروءة وأحدث ملاحظة، وتستخدم أداتا «مفاتيح التبديل السريعة» و«خلفية الشاشة» System Events لتبديل الوضع الداكن وتغيير صورة سطح المكتب. يُطلب الإذن لكل تطبيق على حدة، في أول مرة تحتاجه فيها أداة."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Finder handles Trash and reveal actions you choose. The Mail and Latest Note widgets read your unread count and most recent note, and the Quick Toggles and Wallpaper widgets use System Events to switch Dark Mode and change the desktop picture. Each app is asked about separately, the first time a widget needs it."
          }
        },
