          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Milyen gyakran ellenőrzi az app az értesítési jelvények változásait. A rövidebb időköz naprakészebb jelvényeket, a hosszabb kisebb CPU-terhelést jelent."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "How often notification badges are checked for changes. Shorter keeps badges more current; longer keeps CPU lower."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通知バッジの変化を確認する頻度です。短くするとバッジがより最新になり、長くするとCPU負荷が下がります。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "How often notification badges are checked for changes. Shorter keeps badges more current; longer keeps CPU lower."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "How often notification badges are checked for changes. Shorter keeps badges more current; longer keeps CPU lower."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hoe vaak meldingsbadges worden gecontroleerd op wijzigingen. Kortere tijd zorgt ervoor dat badges actueler blijven; langere tijd zorgt ervoor dat het CPU-gebruik lager blijft."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jak często sprawdzane są zmiany plakietek powiadomień. Krótszy odstęp zapewnia ich większą aktualność, a dłuższy zmniejsza użycie procesora."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Com que frequência os emblemas de notificação são verificados. Intervalos mais curtos mantêm os emblemas mais atuais; mais longos reduzem o uso de CPU."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "How often notification badges are checked for changes. Shorter keeps badges more current; longer keeps CPU lower."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "How often notification badges are checked for changes. Shorter keeps badges more current; longer keeps CPU lower."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Как часто проверяются изменения меток уведомлений. Чем короче, тем актуальнее метки; чем дольше, тем ниже нагрузка на ЦП."
          }
        },
        "sr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "How often notification badges are checked for changes. Shorter keeps badges more current; longer keeps CPU lower."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hur ofta notisbrickor kontrolleras efter ändringar. Kortare intervall håller brickorna mer aktuella; längre ger lägre CPU-användning."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bildirim rozetlerinin değişiklikler için ne sıklıkla kontrol edildiği. Daha kısa süre rozetleri daha güncel tutar; daha uzun süre CPU kullanımını düşük tutar."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "How often notification badges are checked for changes. Shorter keeps badges more current; longer keeps CPU lower."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tần suất kiểm tra thay đổi của huy hiệu thông báo. Thời gian ngắn hơn giúp huy hiệu luôn cập nhật mới nhất; thời gian dài hơn giúp giảm tải CPU."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设定通知徽章的更新检查频率。间隔越短，徽章更新越及时；间隔越长，可降低CPU占用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "設定通知徽章的更新檢查頻率。間隔越短，徽章更新越即時；間隔越長，可降低 CPU 使用率。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
