          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "將此動作包含在控制中心的快速動作列中。若您只想在 Dock 的快速動作小工具中使用此動作，請將其關閉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Include window-less apps, keep grouped apps visible while running, add a separator, and select profiles where running apps are hidden." : {
      "comment" : "Settings control description",
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Include window-less apps, keep grouped apps visible while running, add a separator, and select profiles where running apps are hidden."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تضمين التطبيقات التي بلا نوافذ، وإبقاء التطبيقات المجمّعة ظاهرة أثناء تشغيلها، وإضافة فاصل، وتحديد ملفات التعريف التي تُخفى فيها التطبيقات قيد التشغيل."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Include window-less apps, keep grouped apps visible while running, add a separator, and select profiles where running apps are hidden."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Include window-less apps, keep grouped apps visible while running, add a separator, and select profiles where running apps are hidden."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Include window-less apps, keep grouped apps visible while running, add a separator, and select profiles where running apps are hidden."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apps ohne Fenster einbeziehen, gruppierte Apps während der Ausführung sichtbar lassen, eine Trennlinie hinzufügen und Profile auswählen, in denen laufende Apps ausgeblendet sind."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Include window-less apps, keep grouped apps visible while running, add a separator, and select profiles where running apps are hidden."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Incluye apps sin ventanas, mantén visibles las apps agrupadas mientras están en ejecución, añade un separador y selecciona los perfiles en los que se ocultan las apps en ejecución."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Include window-less apps, keep grouped apps visible while running, add a separator, and select profiles where running apps are hidden."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Inclure les apps sans fenêtre, garder les apps groupées visibles lorsqu'elles sont ouvertes, ajouter un séparateur et choisir les profils où les apps actives sont masquées."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Include window-less apps, keep grouped apps visible while running, add a separator, and select profiles where running apps are hidden."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ablak nélküli appok felvétele, csoportosított appok láthatóan tartása futás közben, elválasztó hozzáadása, és azon profilok kiválasztása, ahol a futó appok rejtve vannak."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Include window-less apps, keep grouped apps visible while running, add a separator, and select profiles where running apps are hidden."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ウインドウのないアプリの表示、グループ化したアプリの実行中の表示維持、区切り線の追加、実行中のアプリを隠すプロファイルの選択。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Include window-less apps, keep grouped apps visible while running, add a separator, and select profiles where running apps are hidden."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Include window-less apps, keep grouped apps visible while running, add a separator, and select profiles where running apps are hidden."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Voeg apps zonder venster toe, houd gegroepeerde apps zichtbaar terwijl ze actief zijn, voeg een scheidingslijn toe en selecteer profielen waarin actieve apps worden verborgen."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Uwzględniaj aplikacje bez okien, pozostawiaj zgrupowane aplikacje widoczne podczas działania, dodaj separator i wybierz profile, w których uruchomione aplikacje są ukryte."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Incluir apps sem janelas, manter as apps agrupadas visíveis enquanto estão em execução, adicionar um separador e selecionar os perfis onde as apps em execução ficam ocultas."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Include window-less apps, keep grouped apps visible while running, add a separator, and select profiles where running apps are hidden."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Include window-less apps, keep grouped apps visible while running, add a separator, and select profiles where running apps are hidden."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Включать приложения без окон, оставлять сгруппированные приложения видимыми во время работы, добавлять разделитель и выбирать профили, где запущенные приложения скрыты."
          }
        },
        "sr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Include window-less apps, keep grouped apps visible while running, add a separator, and select profiles where running apps are hidden."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Inkludera appar utan fönster, håll grupperade appar synliga medan de körs, lägg till en avgränsare och välj profiler där appar som körs är gömda."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Penceresi olmayan uygulamaları dahil et, gruplanmış uygulamaları çalışırken görünür tut, bir ayırıcı ekle ve çalışan uygulamaların gizlendiği profilleri seç."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Include window-less apps, keep grouped apps visible while running, add a separator, and select profiles where running apps are hidden."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bao gồm ứng dụng không có cửa sổ, giữ ứng dụng được nhóm hiển thị khi đang chạy, thêm đường phân chia và chọn các hồ sơ ẩn ứng dụng đang chạy."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "包含没有窗口的应用、让已分组的应用在运行时保持可见、添加分隔线，以及选择隐藏运行中应用的配置文件。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "包含沒有開啟視窗的應用程式、讓群組中的應用程式在執行時保持顯示、新增分隔線，以及選擇要隱藏執行中應用程式的設定檔。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
