    "macOS asks for file access when you choose a folder, use the File Tray with protected locations, or add the Recent Files or Screenshots widget." : {
      "comment" : "Setup permission preflight prompt",
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS asks for file access when you choose a folder, use the File Tray with protected locations, or add the Recent Files or Screenshots widget."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "يطلب macOS الوصول إلى الملفات عندما تختار مجلدًا، أو تستخدم حاوية الملفات مع مواقع محمية، أو تضيف أداة «الملفات الأخيرة» أو «لقطات الشاشة»."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS asks for file access when you choose a folder, use the File Tray with protected locations, or add the Recent Files or Screenshots widget."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS asks for file access when you choose a folder, use the File Tray with protected locations, or add the Recent Files or Screenshots widget."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS asks for file access when you choose a folder, use the File Tray with protected locations, or add the Recent Files or Screenshots widget."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS fragt nach Dateizugriff, wenn Sie einen Ordner auswählen, die Datei-Ablage mit geschützten Orten verwenden oder das Widget „Letzte Dateien“ oder „Bildschirmfotos“ hinzufügen."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS asks for file access when you choose a folder, use the File Tray with protected locations, or add the Recent Files or Screenshots widget."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS pide acceso a los archivos cuando eliges una carpeta, usas la bandeja de archivos con ubicaciones protegidas o añades el widget Archivos recientes o Capturas de pantalla."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS asks for file access when you choose a folder, use the File Tray with protected locations, or add the Recent Files or Screenshots widget."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS demande l'accès aux fichiers lorsque vous choisissez un dossier, utilisez le tiroir de fichiers avec des emplacements protégés, ou ajoutez le widget Fichiers récents ou Captures d'écran."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS asks for file access when you choose a folder, use the File Tray with protected locations, or add the Recent Files or Screenshots widget."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A macOS fájlhozzáférést kér, amikor kiválaszt egy mappát, védett helyekkel használja a Fájltároló Tálcát, vagy hozzáadja a Legutóbbi fájlok vagy a Képernyőfotók widgetet."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS asks for file access when you choose a folder, use the File Tray with protected locations, or add the Recent Files or Screenshots widget."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "フォルダを選択したとき、保護された場所でファイルトレイを使用したとき、または「最近使ったファイル」ウィジェットや「スクリーンショット」ウィジェットを追加したときに、macOSがファイルへのアクセスを確認します。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS asks for file access when you choose a folder, use the File Tray with protected locations, or add the Recent Files or Screenshots widget."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS asks for file access when you choose a folder, use the File Tray with protected locations, or add the Recent Files or Screenshots widget."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS vraagt om bestandstoegang wanneer je een map kiest, het bestandsvak met beveiligde locaties gebruikt of de widget 'Recente bestanden' of 'Screenshots' toevoegt."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS prosi o dostęp do plików, gdy wybierasz folder, używasz Półki plików z chronionymi lokalizacjami lub dodajesz widżet Ostatnie pliki albo Zrzuty ekranu."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O macOS pede acesso aos ficheiros quando escolhe uma pasta, usa o Tabuleiro de Ficheiros com localizações protegidas ou adiciona o widget Ficheiros Recentes ou Capturas de Ecrã."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS asks for file access when you choose a folder, use the File Tray with protected locations, or add the Recent Files or Screenshots widget."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS asks for file access when you choose a folder, use the File Tray with protected locations, or add the Recent Files or Screenshots widget."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS запрашивает доступ к файлам, когда вы выбираете папку, используете лоток файлов с защищенными папками или добавляете виджет «Недавние файлы» или «Снимки экрана»."
          }
        },
        "sr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS asks for file access when you choose a folder, use the File Tray with protected locations, or add the Recent Files or Screenshots widget."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS ber om filåtkomst när du väljer en mapp, använder filbrickan med skyddade platser eller lägger till widgeten Senaste filer eller Skärmavbildningar."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS, bir klasör seçtiğinde, Dosya Tepsisi'ni korumalı konumlarla kullandığında veya Son Dosyalar ya da Ekran Görüntüleri widget'ını eklediğinde dosya erişimi ister."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS asks for file access when you choose a folder, use the File Tray with protected locations, or add the Recent Files or Screenshots widget."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS hỏi quyền truy cập tệp khi bạn chọn một thư mục, dùng Khay tệp với các vị trí được bảo vệ, hoặc thêm tiện ích Tệp gần đây hay Ảnh chụp màn hình."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选择文件夹、通过文件托盘访问受保护的位置，或添加“最近文件”或“截屏”小组件时，macOS 会请求文件访问权限。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "當你選擇檔案夾、在「檔案托盤」中使用受保護的位置，或加入「最近使用的檔案」或「螢幕截圖」小工具時，macOS 會要求檔案存取權限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS has no way to directly ask an app to open a new window, so this button brings the app to the front and sends it the standard ⌘N keyboard shortcut.\n\nMost apps open a new window with ⌘N, but some use it for something else, like a new document, note, or message, and a few ignore it entirely. Whatever the app does when you press ⌘N yourself is what this button will do." : {
      "comment" : "Preview action enablement alert message",
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS has no way to directly ask an app to open a new window, so this button brings the app to the front and sends it the standard ⌘N keyboard shortcut.\n\nMost apps open a new window with ⌘N, but some use it for something else, like a new document, note, or message, and a few ignore it entirely. Whatever the app does when you press ⌘N yourself is what this button will do."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لا يوفر macOS طريقة مباشرة للطلب من تطبيق فتح نافذة جديدة، لذا يجلب هذا الزر التطبيق إلى الواجهة ويرسل إليه اختصار لوحة المفاتيح القياسي ⌘N.\n\nتفتح معظم التطبيقات نافذة جديدة عبر ⌘N، لكن بعضها يستخدمه لشيء آخر، مثل مستند أو ملاحظة أو رسالة جديدة، وقليل منها يتجاهله تمامًا. ما يفعله التطبيق عند ضغطك ⌘N بنفسك هو ما سيفعله هذا الزر."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS has no way to directly ask an app to open a new window, so this button brings the app to the front and sends it the standard ⌘N keyboard shortcut.\n\nMost apps open a new window with ⌘N, but some use it for something else, like a new document, note, or message, and a few ignore it entirely. Whatever the app does when you press ⌘N yourself is what this button will do."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS has no way to directly ask an app to open a new window, so this button brings the app to the front and sends it the standard ⌘N keyboard shortcut.\n\nMost apps open a new window with ⌘N, but some use it for something else, like a new document, note, or message, and a few ignore it entirely. Whatever the app does when you press ⌘N yourself is what this button will do."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS has no way to directly ask an app to open a new window, so this button brings the app to the front and sends it the standard ⌘N keyboard shortcut.\n\nMost apps open a new window with ⌘N, but some use it for something else, like a new document, note, or message, and a few ignore it entirely. Whatever the app does when you press ⌘N yourself is what this button will do."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS bietet keine Möglichkeit, eine App direkt darum zu bitten, ein neues Fenster zu öffnen. Diese Taste holt die App deshalb in den Vordergrund und sendet ihr den standardmäßigen Tastaturkurzbefehl ⌘N.\n\nDie meisten Apps öffnen mit ⌘N ein neues Fenster, einige verwenden ihn jedoch für etwas anderes, etwa ein neues Dokument, eine Notiz oder eine Nachricht, und manche ignorieren ihn ganz. Diese Taste tut genau das, was die App tut, wenn Sie selbst ⌘N drücken."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS has no way to directly ask an app to open a new window, so this button brings the app to the front and sends it the standard ⌘N keyboard shortcut.\n\nMost apps open a new window with ⌘N, but some use it for something else, like a new document, note, or message, and a few ignore it entirely. Whatever the app does when you press ⌘N yourself is what this button will do."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS no tiene una forma directa de pedirle a una app que abra una ventana nueva, así que este botón trae la app al frente y le envía el atajo de teclado estándar ⌘N.\n\nLa mayoría de las apps abren una ventana nueva con ⌘N, pero algunas lo usan para otra cosa, como un documento, una nota o un mensaje nuevos, y unas pocas lo ignoran por completo. Este botón hará exactamente lo mismo que hace la app cuando tú pulsas ⌘N."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS has no way to directly ask an app to open a new window, so this button brings the app to the front and sends it the standard ⌘N keyboard shortcut.\n\nMost apps open a new window with ⌘N, but some use it for something else, like a new document, note, or message, and a few ignore it entirely. Whatever the app does when you press ⌘N yourself is what this button will do."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS n'offre aucun moyen de demander directement à une app d'ouvrir une nouvelle fenêtre, ce bouton amène donc l'app au premier plan et lui envoie le raccourci clavier standard ⌘N.\n\nLa plupart des apps ouvrent une nouvelle fenêtre avec ⌘N, mais certaines l'utilisent pour autre chose, comme un nouveau document, une note ou un message, et quelques-unes l'ignorent complètement. Ce bouton fera exactement ce que fait l'app quand vous appuyez vous-même sur ⌘N."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS has no way to directly ask an app to open a new window, so this button brings the app to the front and sends it the standard ⌘N keyboard shortcut.\n\nMost apps open a new window with ⌘N, but some use it for something else, like a new document, note, or message, and a few ignore it entirely. Whatever the app does when you press ⌘N yourself is what this button will do."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A macOS-ben nincs mód arra, hogy egy appot közvetlenül új ablak megnyitására kérjen, ezért ez a gomb előtérbe hozza az appot, és elküldi neki a szabványos ⌘N billentyűparancsot.\n\nA legtöbb app a ⌘N-re új ablakot nyit, de néhány másra használja, például új dokumentumhoz, jegyzethez vagy üzenethez, és akad, amelyik teljesen figyelmen kívül hagyja. Ez a gomb pontosan azt teszi, amit az app akkor tesz, amikor Ön maga nyomja meg a ⌘N-t."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS has no way to directly ask an app to open a new window, so this button brings the app to the front and sends it the standard ⌘N keyboard shortcut.\n\nMost apps open a new window with ⌘N, but some use it for something else, like a new document, note, or message, and a few ignore it entirely. Whatever the app does when you press ⌘N yourself is what this button will do."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOSにはアプリに新規ウインドウを直接開かせる方法がないため、このボタンはアプリを最前面にして標準の⌘Nキーボードショートカットを送信します。\n\nほとんどのアプリは⌘Nで新規ウインドウを開きますが、新規書類、メモ、メッセージなど別の用途に使うアプリや、完全に無視するアプリもあります。自分で⌘Nを押したときのそのアプリの動作が、このボタンの動作になります。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS has no way to directly ask an app to open a new window, so this button brings the app to the front and sends it the standard ⌘N keyboard shortcut.\n\nMost apps open a new window with ⌘N, but some use it for something else, like a new document, note, or message, and a few ignore it entirely. Whatever the app does when you press ⌘N yourself is what this button will do."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS has no way to directly ask an app to open a new window, so this button brings the app to the front and sends it the standard ⌘N keyboard shortcut.\n\nMost apps open a new window with ⌘N, but some use it for something else, like a new document, note, or message, and a few ignore it entirely. Whatever the app does when you press ⌘N yourself is what this button will do."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS biedt geen mogelijkheid om een app rechtstreeks te vragen een nieuw venster te openen, dus deze knop brengt de app naar de voorgrond en stuurt de standaardtoetscombinatie ⌘N naar de app.\n\nDe meeste apps openen een nieuw venster met ⌘N, maar sommige gebruiken deze combinatie voor iets anders, zoals een nieuw document, een nieuwe notitie of een nieuw bericht, en andere negeren deze combinatie volledig. Wat de app doet wanneer je zelf op ⌘N drukt, dat is precies wat deze knop zal doen."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS nie udostępnia bezpośredniego sposobu na otwarcie nowego okna w aplikacji, dlatego ten przycisk przenosi ją na pierwszy plan i wysyła do niej standardowy skrót klawiaturowy ⌘N.\n\nW większości aplikacji ⌘N otwiera nowe okno, ale niektóre używają tego skrótu do czegoś innego, na przykład utworzenia nowego dokumentu, notatki lub wiadomości, a kilka całkowicie go ignoruje. Ten przycisk wywoła dokładnie tę samą akcję co samodzielne naciśnięcie ⌘N w danej aplikacji."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O macOS não tem forma de pedir diretamente a uma aplicação que abra uma nova janela, por isso este botão traz a aplicação para primeiro plano e envia-lhe o atalho de teclado padrão ⌘N.\n\nA maioria das aplicações abre uma nova janela com ⌘N, mas algumas usam-no para outra coisa, como um novo documento, nota ou mensagem, e algumas ignoram-no por completo. O que a aplicação fizer quando prime ⌘N é o que este botão fará."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS has no way to directly ask an app to open a new window, so this button brings the app to the front and sends it the standard ⌘N keyboard shortcut.\n\nMost apps open a new window with ⌘N, but some use it for something else, like a new document, note, or message, and a few ignore it entirely. Whatever the app does when you press ⌘N yourself is what this button will do."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS has no way to directly ask an app to open a new window, so this button brings the app to the front and sends it the standard ⌘N keyboard shortcut.\n\nMost apps open a new window with ⌘N, but some use it for something else, like a new document, note, or message, and a few ignore it entirely. Whatever the app does when you press ⌘N yourself is what this button will do."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "У macOS нет возможности напрямую попросить приложение открыть новое окно, поэтому эта кнопка выводит приложение на передний план и отправляет ему стандартное сочетание клавиш ⌘N.\n\nБольшинство приложений открывают новое окно по ⌘N, но некоторые используют его для другого, например для нового документа, заметки или сообщения, а некоторые полностью его игнорируют. Что приложение делает, когда вы сами нажимаете ⌘N, то сделает и эта кнопка."
          }
        },
        "sr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS has no way to directly ask an app to open a new window, so this button brings the app to the front and sends it the standard ⌘N keyboard shortcut.\n\nMost apps open a new window with ⌘N, but some use it for something else, like a new document, note, or message, and a few ignore it entirely. Whatever the app does when you press ⌘N yourself is what this button will do."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS har inget sätt att direkt be en app öppna ett nytt fönster, så den här knappen tar fram appen och skickar det vanliga kortkommandot ⌘N till den.\n\nDe flesta appar öppnar ett nytt fönster med ⌘N, men vissa använder det till något annat, som ett nytt dokument, en ny anteckning eller ett nytt meddelande, och några ignorerar det helt. Det appen gör när du själv trycker ⌘N är det knappen kommer att göra."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS'un bir uygulamadan doğrudan yeni pencere açmasını isteyecek bir yolu yok, bu yüzden bu düğme uygulamayı öne getirir ve ona standart ⌘N klavye kısayolunu gönderir.\n\nÇoğu uygulama ⌘N ile yeni pencere açar, ancak bazıları bunu yeni belge, not veya mesaj gibi başka bir şey için kullanır ve birkaçı tamamen yok sayar. ⌘N'ye kendin bastığında uygulama ne yapıyorsa bu düğme de onu yapacaktır."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS has no way to directly ask an app to open a new window, so this button brings the app to the front and sends it the standard ⌘N keyboard shortcut.\n\nMost apps open a new window with ⌘N, but some use it for something else, like a new document, note, or message, and a few ignore it entirely. Whatever the app does when you press ⌘N yourself is what this button will do."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS không có cách nào để yêu cầu trực tiếp một ứng dụng mở một cửa sổ mới, do đó nút này sẽ đưa ứng dụng lên phía trước và gửi lệnh phím tắt bàn phím ⌘N chuẩn cho ứng dụng đó.\n\nHầu hết các ứng dụng sẽ mở một cửa sổ mới bằng phím tắt ⌘N, nhưng một số ứng dụng lại dùng tổ hợp này cho việc khác, chẳng hạn như tạo tài liệu, ghi chú hoặc tin nhắn mới, và một số ít ứng dụng bỏ qua hoàn toàn lệnh này. Bất kể ứng dụng thực hiện hành động gì khi bạn tự mình nhấn ⌘N thì nút này cũng sẽ thực hiện hành động tương tự."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 无法直接要求应用打开新窗口，因此此按钮会将应用切换到前台，并发送标准的 ⌘N 键盘快捷键。\n\n大多数应用会通过 ⌘N 打开新窗口；有些应用会用它新建文稿、笔记或信息，少数应用则不会响应。你在该应用中手动按下 ⌘N 时执行什么操作，此按钮就会执行什么操作。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 無法直接要求應用程式開啟新視窗，因此此按鈕會將應用程式移至最上層，並向其傳送標準的 ⌘N 鍵盤快速鍵。\n\n大多數應用程式會使用 ⌘N 開啟新視窗，但有些應用程式會將其用於其他用途，例如建立新文件、筆記或訊息，也有少數應用程式完全不會用到它。無論你在該應用程式中按下 ⌘N 會執行什麼動作，此按鈕就會執行相同的動作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
