    "macOS owns system shortcuts like Command-Tab and Command-Space. Use DockDoor Pro's Alt-Tab-style shortcuts with an available keybind such as Option-Tab, or pick a custom combination if another app or system setting already uses it." : {
      "comment" : "Keyboard shortcut conflict guidance",
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS owns system shortcuts like Command-Tab and Command-Space. Use DockDoor Pro's Alt-Tab-style shortcuts with an available keybind such as Option-Tab, or pick a custom combination if another app or system setting already uses it."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "يستأثر macOS باختصارات النظام مثل Command-Tab وCommand-Space. استخدم اختصارات DockDoor Pro بأسلوب Alt-Tab مع اختصار متاح مثل Option-Tab، أو اختر تركيبة مخصصة إذا كان تطبيق آخر أو إعداد في النظام يستخدمها بالفعل."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS owns system shortcuts like Command-Tab and Command-Space. Use DockDoor Pro's Alt-Tab-style shortcuts with an available keybind such as Option-Tab, or pick a custom combination if another app or system setting already uses it."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS owns system shortcuts like Command-Tab and Command-Space. Use DockDoor Pro's Alt-Tab-style shortcuts with an available keybind such as Option-Tab, or pick a custom combination if another app or system setting already uses it."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS owns system shortcuts like Command-Tab and Command-Space. Use DockDoor Pro's Alt-Tab-style shortcuts with an available keybind such as Option-Tab, or pick a custom combination if another app or system setting already uses it."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS belegt Systemkurzbefehle wie Befehl-Tab und Befehl-Leertaste. Verwenden Sie die Alt-Tab-ähnlichen Kurzbefehle von DockDoor Pro mit einer verfügbaren Tastenkombination wie Wahl-Tab, oder wählen Sie eine eigene Kombination, wenn eine andere App oder Systemeinstellung sie bereits verwendet."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS owns system shortcuts like Command-Tab and Command-Space. Use DockDoor Pro's Alt-Tab-style shortcuts with an available keybind such as Option-Tab, or pick a custom combination if another app or system setting already uses it."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS reserva los atajos del sistema como Comando-Tab y Comando-Espacio. Usa los atajos estilo Alt-Tab de DockDoor Pro con una combinación disponible como Opción-Tab, o elige una combinación personalizada si otra app o un ajuste del sistema ya la usa."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS owns system shortcuts like Command-Tab and Command-Space. Use DockDoor Pro's Alt-Tab-style shortcuts with an available keybind such as Option-Tab, or pick a custom combination if another app or system setting already uses it."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS réserve les raccourcis système comme Commande-Tab et Commande-Espace. Utilisez les raccourcis de style Alt-Tab de DockDoor Pro avec une combinaison disponible comme Option-Tab, ou choisissez une combinaison personnalisée si une autre app ou un réglage système l'utilise déjà."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS owns system shortcuts like Command-Tab and Command-Space. Use DockDoor Pro's Alt-Tab-style shortcuts with an available keybind such as Option-Tab, or pick a custom combination if another app or system setting already uses it."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A rendszerszintű billentyűparancsok, mint a Command-Tab és a Command-Space, a macOS-hez tartoznak. Használja a DockDoor Pro Alt-Tab-stílusú parancsait egy szabad billentyűkombinációval, például az Option-Tab-bal, vagy válasszon egyéni kombinációt, ha egy másik app vagy rendszerbeállítás már használja azt."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS owns system shortcuts like Command-Tab and Command-Space. Use DockDoor Pro's Alt-Tab-style shortcuts with an available keybind such as Option-Tab, or pick a custom combination if another app or system setting already uses it."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Command-TabやCommand-Spaceなどのシステムショートカットは、macOSが管理しています。DockDoor ProのAlt-Tab方式のショートカットにはOption-Tabなど空いているキーバインドを使うか、ほかのアプリやシステム設定と重複する場合はカスタムの組み合わせを選んでください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS owns system shortcuts like Command-Tab and Command-Space. Use DockDoor Pro's Alt-Tab-style shortcuts with an available keybind such as Option-Tab, or pick a custom combination if another app or system setting already uses it."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS owns system shortcuts like Command-Tab and Command-Space. Use DockDoor Pro's Alt-Tab-style shortcuts with an available keybind such as Option-Tab, or pick a custom combination if another app or system setting already uses it."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS heeft de systeemsneltoetsen zoals Command-Tab en Command-Space onder zijn beheer. Gebruik de Alt-Tab-achtige sneltoetsen van DockDoor Pro met een beschikbare toetscombinatie zoals Option-Tab, of kies een aangepaste combinatie als deze al door een andere app of systeeminstelling wordt gebruikt."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS zastrzega skróty systemowe, takie jak Command-Tab i Command-Space. Używaj skrótów DockDoor Pro w stylu Alt-Tab z dostępną kombinacją, taką jak Option-Tab, albo wybierz własną kombinację, jeśli inna aplikacja lub ustawienie systemowe już jej używa."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O macOS reserva os atalhos de sistema, como Comando-Tab e Comando-Espaço. Use os atalhos ao estilo Alt-Tab do DockDoor Pro com uma combinação disponível, como Opção-Tab, ou escolha uma combinação personalizada se outra aplicação ou definição do sistema já usar essa combinação."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS owns system shortcuts like Command-Tab and Command-Space. Use DockDoor Pro's Alt-Tab-style shortcuts with an available keybind such as Option-Tab, or pick a custom combination if another app or system setting already uses it."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS owns system shortcuts like Command-Tab and Command-Space. Use DockDoor Pro's Alt-Tab-style shortcuts with an available keybind such as Option-Tab, or pick a custom combination if another app or system setting already uses it."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS владеет системными сочетаниями клавиш, такими как Command-Tab и Command-Space. Используйте Alt-Tab-подобные сочетания DockDoor Pro с доступной комбинацией, например Option-Tab, или выберите пользовательскую комбинацию, если другое приложение или системная настройка уже использует её."
          }
        },
        "sr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS owns system shortcuts like Command-Tab and Command-Space. Use DockDoor Pro's Alt-Tab-style shortcuts with an available keybind such as Option-Tab, or pick a custom combination if another app or system setting already uses it."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS äger systemkortkommandon som kommando-tab och kommando-mellanslag. Använd DockDoor Pros kortkommandon i Alt-Tab-stil med en ledig kombination som alternativ-tab, eller välj en egen kombination om en annan app eller systeminställning redan använder den."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS, Command-Tab ve Command-Space gibi sistem kısayollarına sahiptir. DockDoor Pro'nun Alt-Tab tarzı kısayollarını Option-Tab gibi kullanılabilir bir tuş atamasıyla kullan veya başka bir uygulama ya da sistem ayarı zaten kullanıyorsa özel bir kombinasyon seç."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS owns system shortcuts like Command-Tab and Command-Space. Use DockDoor Pro's Alt-Tab-style shortcuts with an available keybind such as Option-Tab, or pick a custom combination if another app or system setting already uses it."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS sở hữu các phím tắt hệ thống như Command-Tab và Command-Space. Hãy sử dụng các phím tắt kiểu Alt-Tab của DockDoor Pro với một tổ hợp phím sẵn có như Option-Tab, hoặc chọn một tổ hợp tùy chỉnh nếu một ứng dụng khác hoặc cài đặt hệ thống đã sử dụng tổ hợp đó rồi."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 会占用 Command-Tab 和 Command-Space 等系统快捷键。请使用 DockDoor Pro 的 Alt-Tab 风格快捷键，并选择可用的组合，例如 Option-Tab；如果该组合已被其他应用或系统设置占用，也可以自定义快捷键组合。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 會保留 Command-Tab、Command-Space 等系統快速鍵。DockDoor Pro 的 Alt-Tab 類型快速鍵請使用可用的按鍵組合，例如 Option-Tab；若已被其他 App 或系統功能占用，請改用其他自訂組合。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
