    "Nothing is requested until you place one of these widgets, and nothing leaves your Mac. Remove the widget and DockDoor Pro stops reading that data. You can revoke any of these later in Privacy & Security." : {
      "comment" : "Setup permission preflight reassurance",
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Nothing is requested until you place one of these widgets, and nothing leaves your Mac. Remove the widget and DockDoor Pro stops reading that data. You can revoke any of these later in Privacy & Security."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لا يُطلب أي شيء حتى تضع إحدى هذه الأدوات، ولا يغادر أي شيء جهاز Mac. أزل الأداة وسيتوقف DockDoor Pro عن قراءة تلك البيانات. يمكنك إلغاء أي من هذه الأذونات لاحقًا من الخصوصية والأمن."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Nothing is requested until you place one of these widgets, and nothing leaves your Mac. Remove the widget and DockDoor Pro stops reading that data. You can revoke any of these later in Privacy & Security."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Nothing is requested until you place one of these widgets, and nothing leaves your Mac. Remove the widget and DockDoor Pro stops reading that data. You can revoke any of these later in Privacy & Security."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Nothing is requested until you place one of these widgets, and nothing leaves your Mac. Remove the widget and DockDoor Pro stops reading that data. You can revoke any of these later in Privacy & Security."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Es wird nichts angefordert, bis Sie eines dieser Widgets platzieren, und nichts verlässt Ihren Mac. Entfernen Sie das Widget, liest DockDoor Pro diese Daten nicht mehr. Sie können jede dieser Berechtigungen später unter „Datenschutz & Sicherheit“ widerrufen."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Nothing is requested until you place one of these widgets, and nothing leaves your Mac. Remove the widget and DockDoor Pro stops reading that data. You can revoke any of these later in Privacy & Security."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No se solicita nada hasta que colocas uno de estos widgets, y nada sale de tu Mac. Si eliminas el widget, DockDoor Pro deja de leer esos datos. Puedes revocar cualquiera de estos permisos más adelante en Privacidad y seguridad."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Nothing is requested until you place one of these widgets, and nothing leaves your Mac. Remove the widget and DockDoor Pro stops reading that data. You can revoke any of these later in Privacy & Security."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rien n'est demandé tant que vous n'avez pas placé l'un de ces widgets, et rien ne quitte votre Mac. Retirez le widget et DockDoor Pro cesse de lire ces données. Vous pouvez révoquer chacun de ces accès plus tard dans Confidentialité et sécurité."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Nothing is requested until you place one of these widgets, and nothing leaves your Mac. Remove the widget and DockDoor Pro stops reading that data. You can revoke any of these later in Privacy & Security."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Semmilyen hozzáférést nem kér, amíg el nem helyez egy ilyen widgetet, és semmi sem hagyja el a Macet. Ha eltávolítja a widgetet, a DockDoor Pro leállítja az adatok olvasását. Ezeket később bármikor visszavonhatja az Adatvédelem és biztonság részben."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Nothing is requested until you place one of these widgets, and nothing leaves your Mac. Remove the widget and DockDoor Pro stops reading that data. You can revoke any of these later in Privacy & Security."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "これらのウィジェットを配置するまで何も要求されることはなく、データがMacの外に送信されることもありません。ウィジェットを削除すると、DockDoor Proはそのデータの読み取りを停止します。これらの許可は、あとで「プライバシーとセキュリティ」でいつでも取り消せます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Nothing is requested until you place one of these widgets, and nothing leaves your Mac. Remove the widget and DockDoor Pro stops reading that data. You can revoke any of these later in Privacy & Security."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Nothing is requested until you place one of these widgets, and nothing leaves your Mac. Remove the widget and DockDoor Pro stops reading that data. You can revoke any of these later in Privacy & Security."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Er wordt niets gevraagd totdat je een van deze widgets plaatst, en er verlaat niets je Mac. Verwijder de widget en DockDoor Pro stopt met het lezen van die gegevens. Je kunt elk van deze toestemmingen later intrekken in Privacy en beveiliging."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Prośby o dostęp pojawiają się dopiero po dodaniu jednego z tych widżetów, a dane nie opuszczają Twojego Maca. Po usunięciu widżetu DockDoor Pro przestaje odczytywać jego dane. Każde z tych uprawnień możesz później cofnąć w sekcji Prywatność i ochrona."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nada é pedido até colocar um destes widgets, e nada sai do seu Mac. Se remover o widget, o DockDoor Pro deixa de ler esses dados. Pode revogar qualquer um destes acessos mais tarde em Privacidade e segurança."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Nothing is requested until you place one of these widgets, and nothing leaves your Mac. Remove the widget and DockDoor Pro stops reading that data. You can revoke any of these later in Privacy & Security."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Nothing is requested until you place one of these widgets, and nothing leaves your Mac. Remove the widget and DockDoor Pro stops reading that data. You can revoke any of these later in Privacy & Security."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ничего не запрашивается, пока вы не разместите один из этих виджетов, и никакие данные не покидают ваш Mac. Удалите виджет, и DockDoor Pro перестанет читать эти данные. Любое из этих разрешений можно отозвать позже в разделе «Конфиденциальность и безопасность»."
          }
        },
        "sr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Nothing is requested until you place one of these widgets, and nothing leaves your Mac. Remove the widget and DockDoor Pro stops reading that data. You can revoke any of these later in Privacy & Security."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Inget efterfrågas förrän du placerar ut någon av de här widgetarna, och inget lämnar din Mac. Ta bort widgeten så slutar DockDoor Pro att läsa de uppgifterna. Du kan återkalla alla dessa senare under Integritet och säkerhet."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bu widget'lardan birini yerleştirene kadar hiçbir şey istenmez ve hiçbir şey Mac'inden çıkmaz. Widget'ı kaldır, DockDoor Pro o veriyi okumayı bırakır. Bunların herhangi birini daha sonra Gizlilik & Güvenlik'ten geri alabilirsin."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Nothing is requested until you place one of these widgets, and nothing leaves your Mac. Remove the widget and DockDoor Pro stops reading that data. You can revoke any of these later in Privacy & Security."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Không có yêu cầu nào cho đến khi bạn đặt một trong các tiện ích này, và không dữ liệu nào rời khỏi máy Mac của bạn. Gỡ tiện ích thì DockDoor Pro sẽ ngừng đọc dữ liệu đó. Bạn có thể thu hồi bất kỳ quyền nào sau này trong Quyền riêng tư & Bảo mật."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "添加这些小组件前不会请求任何权限，数据也不会离开您的 Mac。移除小组件后，DockDoor Pro 会停止读取相应数据。您之后可在“隐私与安全性”中撤销任何权限。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在你加入這些小工具之前，DockDoor Pro 不會要求任何存取權限，資料也不會離開你的 Mac。移除小工具後，DockDoor Pro 就會停止讀取相關資料。你之後隨時可以在「隱私權與安全性」中撤銷這些權限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
