          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「起動中のアプリ」には実行中のアプリが表示されます。アプリを長押しするとウインドウプレビューが表示されます(Dockの「ウインドウプレビュー」設定で制御)。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Open Apps shows your running apps. Long-press an app to see its window previews (controlled by the dock's Window Previews setting)."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Open Apps shows your running apps. Long-press an app to see its window previews (controlled by the dock's Window Previews setting)."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Onder 'Geopende apps' zie je welke apps er op dit moment actief zijn. Houd een app lang ingedrukt om voorbeelden van de vensters te bekijken (dit wordt geregeld via de instelling 'Venstervoorbeelden' in het Dock)."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Na stronie Otwarte aplikacje wyświetlane są uruchomione aplikacje. Kliknij i przytrzymaj aplikację, aby zobaczyć podglądy jej okien. Działaniem tej funkcji steruje ustawienie Podglądy okien."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aplicações abertas mostra as aplicações em execução. Prima prolongadamente uma aplicação para ver as pré-visualizações das janelas (controlado pela definição Pré-visualizações de janelas da dock)."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Open Apps shows your running apps. Long-press an app to see its window previews (controlled by the dock's Window Previews setting)."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Open Apps shows your running apps. Long-press an app to see its window previews (controlled by the dock's Window Previews setting)."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "«Открытые приложения» показывает ваши запущенные приложения. Долгое нажатие на приложение открывает предпросмотр его окон (управляется параметром «Предпросмотр окон» в Dock)."
          }
        },
        "sr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Open Apps shows your running apps. Long-press an app to see its window previews (controlled by the dock's Window Previews setting)."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Öppna appar visar dina appar som körs. Tryck länge på en app för att se dess fönsterförhandsvisningar (styrs av dockans inställning Fönsterförhandsvisningar)."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Açık Uygulamalar çalışan uygulamalarını gösterir. Pencere önizlemelerini görmek için bir uygulamaya uzun bas (dock'un Pencere Önizlemeleri ayarıyla denetlenir)."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Open Apps shows your running apps. Long-press an app to see its window previews (controlled by the dock's Window Previews setting)."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ứng dụng đang mở hiển thị các ứng dụng đang chạy của bạn. Nhấn giữ ứng dụng để xem trước cửa sổ (được điều khiển bởi cài đặt Bản xem trước Cửa sổ của dock)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“运行中的应用”会显示当前正在运行的应用。长按某个应用可查看其窗口预览（是否显示由 Dock 的“窗口预览”设置控制）。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「已開啟的應用程式」會顯示您正在執行的應用程式。長按應用程式即可查看其視窗預覽（受 Dock 的「視窗預覽」設定控制）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
