    "Quick Actions fill a single row at the foot of the Control Center; past eight, the last cell opens a page with the rest. To put them on the dock itself, add a Quick Actions widget to a widget stack." : {
      "comment" : "Quick Actions settings note",
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Quick Actions fill a single row at the foot of the Control Center; past eight, the last cell opens a page with the rest. To put them on the dock itself, add a Quick Actions widget to a widget stack."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تملأ الإجراءات السريعة صفًا واحدًا في أسفل مركز التحكم؛ وبعد ثمانية إجراءات، تفتح الخانة الأخيرة صفحة بالبقية. لوضعها على Dock نفسه، أضف أداة «الإجراءات السريعة» إلى مكدس أدوات."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Quick Actions fill a single row at the foot of the Control Center; past eight, the last cell opens a page with the rest. To put them on the dock itself, add a Quick Actions widget to a widget stack."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Quick Actions fill a single row at the foot of the Control Center; past eight, the last cell opens a page with the rest. To put them on the dock itself, add a Quick Actions widget to a widget stack."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Quick Actions fill a single row at the foot of the Control Center; past eight, the last cell opens a page with the rest. To put them on the dock itself, add a Quick Actions widget to a widget stack."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Schnellaktionen füllen eine einzelne Zeile am unteren Rand des Kontrollzentrums; bei mehr als acht öffnet die letzte Zelle eine Seite mit den übrigen. Um sie direkt im Dock zu platzieren, fügen Sie einem Widget-Stapel ein Schnellaktionen-Widget hinzu."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Quick Actions fill a single row at the foot of the Control Center; past eight, the last cell opens a page with the rest. To put them on the dock itself, add a Quick Actions widget to a widget stack."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las acciones rápidas ocupan una sola fila en la parte inferior del Centro de control; a partir de ocho, la última celda abre una página con el resto. Para ponerlas en el propio Dock, añade un widget Acciones rápidas a una pila de widgets."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Quick Actions fill a single row at the foot of the Control Center; past eight, the last cell opens a page with the rest. To put them on the dock itself, add a Quick Actions widget to a widget stack."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les actions rapides remplissent une seule rangée au bas du Centre de contrôle ; au-delà de huit, la dernière case ouvre une page avec les autres. Pour les placer directement sur le dock, ajoutez un widget Actions rapides à une pile de widgets."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Quick Actions fill a single row at the foot of the Control Center; past eight, the last cell opens a page with the rest. To put them on the dock itself, add a Quick Actions widget to a widget stack."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A Gyorsműveletek egyetlen sort töltenek ki a Vezérlőközpont alján; nyolc felett az utolsó cella egy lapot nyit a többivel. Ha magára a Dockra szeretné tenni őket, adjon hozzá egy Gyorsműveletek widgetet egy widgetköteghez."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Quick Actions fill a single row at the foot of the Control Center; past eight, the last cell opens a page with the rest. To put them on the dock itself, add a Quick Actions widget to a widget stack."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "クイックアクションはコントロールセンター下部の1行に表示されます。8個を超えると、最後のセルから残りのアクションのページが開きます。Dock上に配置するには、ウィジェットスタックに「クイックアクション」ウィジェットを追加してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Quick Actions fill a single row at the foot of the Control Center; past eight, the last cell opens a page with the rest. To put them on the dock itself, add a Quick Actions widget to a widget stack."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Quick Actions fill a single row at the foot of the Control Center; past eight, the last cell opens a page with the rest. To put them on the dock itself, add a Quick Actions widget to a widget stack."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Snelle acties vullen één rij onderaan het Control Center; bij meer dan acht opent de laatste cel een pagina met de rest. Voeg een widget 'Snelle acties' toe aan een widgetstapel om ze in het Dock zelf te plaatsen."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Szybkie akcje zajmują jeden wiersz u dołu Centrum sterowania. Jeśli jest ich więcej niż osiem, ostatnia komórka otwiera stronę z pozostałymi. Aby umieścić je w samym Docku, dodaj widżet Szybkie akcje do stosu widżetów."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "As Ações Rápidas preenchem uma única fila no fundo da Central de controlo; a partir de oito, a última célula abre uma página com as restantes. Para as colocar na própria Dock, adicione um widget Ações Rápidas a uma pilha de widgets."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Quick Actions fill a single row at the foot of the Control Center; past eight, the last cell opens a page with the rest. To put them on the dock itself, add a Quick Actions widget to a widget stack."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Quick Actions fill a single row at the foot of the Control Center; past eight, the last cell opens a page with the rest. To put them on the dock itself, add a Quick Actions widget to a widget stack."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Быстрые действия занимают один ряд внизу Пункта управления; если их больше восьми, последняя ячейка открывает страницу с остальными. Чтобы разместить их прямо в Dock, добавьте виджет «Быстрые действия» в стопку виджетов."
          }
        },
        "sr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Quick Actions fill a single row at the foot of the Control Center; past eight, the last cell opens a page with the rest. To put them on the dock itself, add a Quick Actions widget to a widget stack."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Snabbåtgärder fyller en enda rad längst ned i Kontrollcenter. Om det finns fler än åtta öppnar den sista cellen en sida med resten. Om du vill ha dem direkt i dockan lägger du till en Snabbåtgärder-widget i en widgetstack."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hızlı Eylemler Denetim Merkezi'nin alt kısmındaki tek bir satırı doldurur; sekizden sonra son hücre kalanların olduğu bir sayfa açar. Bunları dock'un kendisine koymak için bir widget yığınına Hızlı Eylemler widget'ı ekle."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Quick Actions fill a single row at the foot of the Control Center; past eight, the last cell opens a page with the rest. To put them on the dock itself, add a Quick Actions widget to a widget stack."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tác vụ nhanh lấp đầy một hàng ở cuối Trung tâm điều khiển; khi có hơn tám tác vụ, ô cuối cùng sẽ mở một trang chứa các tác vụ còn lại. Để đặt chúng ngay trên dock, hãy thêm tiện ích Tác vụ nhanh vào một ngăn xếp tiện ích."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "快捷操作在控制中心底部占用一行；超过八个时，最后一个单元格可打开显示其余操作的页面。要将快捷操作放到 Dock 上，请在小组件叠放中添加“快捷操作”小组件。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「快速動作」會顯示在「控制中心」底部的單一橫列中；超過八個時，最後一格會開啟頁面以顯示其餘項目。若要將「快速動作」直接放在 Dock 上，請將「快速動作」小工具加入小工具堆疊。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
