    "Shortcut fields show the full key combination. To change one shortcut, click its field and press the keys you want. Initializer-based shortcuts marked Overridden ignore global initializer changes until they match again." : {
      "comment" : "Keyboard shortcut recording guidance",
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Shortcut fields show the full key combination. To change one shortcut, click its field and press the keys you want. Initializer-based shortcuts marked Overridden ignore global initializer changes until they match again."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تعرض حقول الاختصارات تركيبة المفاتيح كاملةً. لتغيير اختصار واحد، انقر على حقله واضغط على المفاتيح التي تريدها. الاختصارات المعتمدة على مفتاح البدء والموسومة بأنها متجاوَزة تتجاهل تغييرات مفتاح البدء العام حتى تعود إلى التطابق معه."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Shortcut fields show the full key combination. To change one shortcut, click its field and press the keys you want. Initializer-based shortcuts marked Overridden ignore global initializer changes until they match again."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Shortcut fields show the full key combination. To change one shortcut, click its field and press the keys you want. Initializer-based shortcuts marked Overridden ignore global initializer changes until they match again."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Shortcut fields show the full key combination. To change one shortcut, click its field and press the keys you want. Initializer-based shortcuts marked Overridden ignore global initializer changes until they match again."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kurzbefehlfelder zeigen die vollständige Tastenkombination. Um einen Kurzbefehl zu ändern, klicken Sie in das Feld und drücken Sie die gewünschten Tasten. Als „Überschrieben“ markierte Kurzbefehle mit Auslösetaste ignorieren Änderungen an der globalen Auslösetaste, bis die Auslösetasten wieder übereinstimmen."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Shortcut fields show the full key combination. To change one shortcut, click its field and press the keys you want. Initializer-based shortcuts marked Overridden ignore global initializer changes until they match again."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los campos de atajo muestran la combinación de teclas completa. Para cambiar un atajo, haz clic en su campo y pulsa las teclas que quieras. Los atajos basados en el inicializador marcados como Anulado ignoran los cambios del inicializador global hasta que vuelvan a coincidir."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Shortcut fields show the full key combination. To change one shortcut, click its field and press the keys you want. Initializer-based shortcuts marked Overridden ignore global initializer changes until they match again."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les champs de raccourci affichent la combinaison de touches complète. Pour modifier un raccourci, cliquez sur son champ puis appuyez sur les touches voulues. Les raccourcis basés sur le déclencheur marqués « Remplacé » ignorent les modifications du déclencheur global jusqu'à ce qu'ils correspondent à nouveau."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Shortcut fields show the full key combination. To change one shortcut, click its field and press the keys you want. Initializer-based shortcuts marked Overridden ignore global initializer changes until they match again."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A billentyűparancs-mezők a teljes billentyűkombinációt mutatják. Egy parancs módosításához kattintson a mezőjére, és nyomja le a kívánt billentyűket. A Felülbírálva jelölésű, indítóbillentyű-alapú parancsok figyelmen kívül hagyják a globális indítóbillentyű módosításait, amíg újra nem egyeznek."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Shortcut fields show the full key combination. To change one shortcut, click its field and press the keys you want. Initializer-based shortcuts marked Overridden ignore global initializer changes until they match again."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ショートカット欄にはキーの組み合わせ全体が表示されます。個々のショートカットを変更するには、その欄をクリックして希望のキーを押します。「上書き済み」と表示されたイニシャライザベースのショートカットは、再び一致するまでグローバルなイニシャライザの変更を無視します。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Shortcut fields show the full key combination. To change one shortcut, click its field and press the keys you want. Initializer-based shortcuts marked Overridden ignore global initializer changes until they match again."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Shortcut fields show the full key combination. To change one shortcut, click its field and press the keys you want. Initializer-based shortcuts marked Overridden ignore global initializer changes until they match again."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In de sneltoetsvelden wordt de volledige toetscombinatie weergegeven. Om een sneltoets te wijzigen, klik je op het betreffende veld en druk je op de gewenste toetsen. Sneltoetsen op basis van initialisatoren die zijn gemarkeerd als 'Overschreven' negeren wijzigingen in de globale initialisator totdat ze weer overeenkomen."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pola skrótów pokazują pełną kombinację klawiszy. Aby zmienić skrót, kliknij w jego pole i naciśnij wybrane klawisze. Skróty oparte na klawiszu inicjującym, oznaczone jako Zmienione, nie uwzględniają zmian ustawienia globalnego, dopóki ponownie nie będą z nim zgodne."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Os campos de atalho mostram a combinação de teclas completa. Para alterar um atalho, clique no campo respetivo e prima as teclas pretendidas. Os atalhos baseados no inicializador assinalados como Substituído ignoram alterações globais do inicializador até voltarem a coincidir."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Shortcut fields show the full key combination. To change one shortcut, click its field and press the keys you want. Initializer-based shortcuts marked Overridden ignore global initializer changes until they match again."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Shortcut fields show the full key combination. To change one shortcut, click its field and press the keys you want. Initializer-based shortcuts marked Overridden ignore global initializer changes until they match again."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Поля сочетаний клавиш показывают полную комбинацию. Чтобы изменить сочетание, нажмите на его поле и нажмите нужные клавиши. Сочетания на основе клавиши-инициатора, помеченные как «Переопределено», игнорируют изменения глобальной клавиши-инициатора, пока снова не совпадут."
          }
        },
        "sr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Shortcut fields show the full key combination. To change one shortcut, click its field and press the keys you want. Initializer-based shortcuts marked Overridden ignore global initializer changes until they match again."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kortkommandofälten visar hela tangentkombinationen. Om du vill ändra ett kortkommando klickar du på dess fält och trycker på de tangenter du vill använda. Initierarbaserade kortkommandon som är markerade som Åsidosatta ignorerar globala initierarändringar tills de matchar igen."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kısayol alanları tuş kombinasyonunun tamamını gösterir. Bir kısayolu değiştirmek için alanına tıkla ve istediğin tuşlara bas. Geçersiz Kılındı olarak işaretlenen başlatıcı tabanlı kısayollar, yeniden eşleşene kadar genel başlatıcı değişikliklerini yok sayar."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Shortcut fields show the full key combination. To change one shortcut, click its field and press the keys you want. Initializer-based shortcuts marked Overridden ignore global initializer changes until they match again."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Các trường phím tắt hiển thị đầy đủ tổ hợp phím. Để thay đổi một phím tắt, hãy nhấp vào trường tương ứng và nhấn các phím bạn muốn. Các phím tắt dựa trên trình khởi tạo được đánh dấu Bị ghi đè sẽ bỏ qua các thay đổi trình khởi tạo toàn hệ thống cho đến khi chúng khớp lại."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "快捷键设置项会显示完整的按键组合。要修改某个快捷键，请点击对应的设置项，然后按下新的按键组合。标记为“已覆盖”的基于起始键的快捷键不会跟随全局起始键的变更，直到重新与全局设置保持一致。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "快速鍵欄位會顯示完整的按鍵組合。若要修改快速鍵，請按一下對應欄位後按下所需的按鍵。標示為「已覆寫」的初始化鍵快速鍵，在設定與全域初始化鍵再次一致之前，不會套用全域初始化鍵的變更。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
