    "Some built-in widgets show personal data. macOS asks for each kind of data the first time you add a widget that uses it, never during setup." : {
      "comment" : "Setup permission preflight prompt",
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Some built-in widgets show personal data. macOS asks for each kind of data the first time you add a widget that uses it, never during setup."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تعرض بعض الأدوات المدمجة بيانات شخصية. يطلب macOS الإذن لكل نوع من البيانات في أول مرة تضيف فيها أداة تستخدمه، وليس أثناء الإعداد أبدًا."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Some built-in widgets show personal data. macOS asks for each kind of data the first time you add a widget that uses it, never during setup."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Some built-in widgets show personal data. macOS asks for each kind of data the first time you add a widget that uses it, never during setup."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Some built-in widgets show personal data. macOS asks for each kind of data the first time you add a widget that uses it, never during setup."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Einige integrierte Widgets zeigen persönliche Daten an. macOS fragt nach jeder Datenart, wenn Sie zum ersten Mal ein Widget hinzufügen, das sie verwendet, niemals während der Einrichtung."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Some built-in widgets show personal data. macOS asks for each kind of data the first time you add a widget that uses it, never during setup."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Algunos widgets integrados muestran datos personales. macOS pide permiso para cada tipo de datos la primera vez que añades un widget que los usa, nunca durante la configuración."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Some built-in widgets show personal data. macOS asks for each kind of data the first time you add a widget that uses it, never during setup."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Certains widgets intégrés affichent des données personnelles. macOS demande l'accès à chaque type de données la première fois que vous ajoutez un widget qui l'utilise, jamais pendant la configuration."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Some built-in widgets show personal data. macOS asks for each kind of data the first time you add a widget that uses it, never during setup."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Egyes beépített widgetek személyes adatokat jelenítenek meg. A macOS minden adattípusra akkor kér engedélyt, amikor először ad hozzá egy azt használó widgetet, a beállítás során soha."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Some built-in widgets show personal data. macOS asks for each kind of data the first time you add a widget that uses it, never during setup."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一部の内蔵ウィジェットは個人データを表示します。macOSは、各種類のデータを使用するウィジェットを初めて追加したときに確認し、セットアップ中に確認することはありません。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Some built-in widgets show personal data. macOS asks for each kind of data the first time you add a widget that uses it, never during setup."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Some built-in widgets show personal data. macOS asks for each kind of data the first time you add a widget that uses it, never during setup."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sommige ingebouwde widgets tonen persoonlijke gegevens. macOS vraagt om elk soort gegevens de eerste keer dat je een widget toevoegt die ze gebruikt, nooit tijdens de installatie."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Niektóre wbudowane widżety wyświetlają dane osobiste. macOS prosi o dostęp do każdego rodzaju danych przy pierwszym dodaniu widżetu, który z nich korzysta, nigdy podczas konfiguracji."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Alguns widgets integrados mostram dados pessoais. O macOS pede acesso a cada tipo de dados na primeira vez que adiciona um widget que os usa, nunca durante a configuração."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Some built-in widgets show personal data. macOS asks for each kind of data the first time you add a widget that uses it, never during setup."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Some built-in widgets show personal data. macOS asks for each kind of data the first time you add a widget that uses it, never during setup."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Некоторые встроенные виджеты показывают личные данные. macOS запрашивает доступ к каждому типу данных, когда вы впервые добавляете виджет, который их использует, и никогда во время настройки."
          }
        },
        "sr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Some built-in widgets show personal data. macOS asks for each kind of data the first time you add a widget that uses it, never during setup."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vissa inbyggda widgetar visar personliga uppgifter. macOS frågar om varje typ av data första gången du lägger till en widget som använder den, aldrig under konfigureringen."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bazı yerleşik widget'lar kişisel veri gösterir. macOS, o veriyi kullanan bir widget'ı eklediğin ilk seferde, kurulum sırasında asla değil, her veri türü için izin ister."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Some built-in widgets show personal data. macOS asks for each kind of data the first time you add a widget that uses it, never during setup."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Một số tiện ích tích hợp hiển thị dữ liệu cá nhân. macOS hỏi quyền cho từng loại dữ liệu vào lần đầu tiên bạn thêm tiện ích sử dụng dữ liệu đó, không bao giờ trong quá trình thiết lập."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "部分内置小组件会显示个人数据。首次添加需要相应数据的小组件时，macOS 才会请求权限，初始设置时不会请求。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "部分內建小工具會顯示個人資料。首次加入需要使用特定資料的小工具時，macOS 才會要求相應的取用權限，設定過程中不會要求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Some setup choices affect macOS behavior, such as Launch on Login or hiding the native Dock." : {
      "comment" : "Setup permission preflight prompt",
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Some setup choices affect macOS behavior, such as Launch on Login or hiding the native Dock."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تؤثر بعض خيارات الإعداد في سلوك macOS، مثل التشغيل عند تسجيل الدخول أو إخفاء شريط Dock الأصلي."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Some setup choices affect macOS behavior, such as Launch on Login or hiding the native Dock."
          }
