          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将菜单栏应用和后台（Agent）应用的最小化窗口以磁贴形式显示在 Dock 末尾，类似于 macOS 原生 Dock。点击磁贴即可恢复对应窗口。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "將選單列與背景（代理）應用程式中最小化的視窗，以圖塊形式顯示在 Dock 的末端，如同原生 Dock 的運作方式。按一下圖塊即可還原視窗。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Surface minimized windows from menu bar and background apps as tiles at the end of the dock, like the native Dock parks them near Trash. Click a tile to restore that window." : {
      "comment" : "Settings control description",
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
