    "These are settings you control. Keep the menu bar icon on until you know how to reopen Settings, and restore the native Dock from Placement & Hiding if needed." : {
      "comment" : "Setup permission preflight reassurance",
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "These are settings you control. Keep the menu bar icon on until you know how to reopen Settings, and restore the native Dock from Placement & Hiding if needed."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "هذه إعدادات تتحكم بها أنت. أبقِ أيقونة شريط القائمة ظاهرة حتى تعرف كيفية إعادة فتح الإعدادات، واستعد شريط Dock الأصلي من قسم الموضع والإخفاء عند الحاجة."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "These are settings you control. Keep the menu bar icon on until you know how to reopen Settings, and restore the native Dock from Placement & Hiding if needed."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "These are settings you control. Keep the menu bar icon on until you know how to reopen Settings, and restore the native Dock from Placement & Hiding if needed."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "These are settings you control. Keep the menu bar icon on until you know how to reopen Settings, and restore the native Dock from Placement & Hiding if needed."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Diese Einstellungen steuern Sie selbst. Lassen Sie das Menüleistensymbol aktiviert, bis Sie wissen, wie Sie die Einstellungen erneut öffnen, und stellen Sie das native Dock bei Bedarf unter „Platzierung & Ausblenden“ wieder her."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "These are settings you control. Keep the menu bar icon on until you know how to reopen Settings, and restore the native Dock from Placement & Hiding if needed."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Estos son ajustes que tú controlas. Mantén activado el icono de la barra de menús hasta que sepas cómo reabrir Ajustes, y restaura el Dock nativo desde Colocación y ocultación si es necesario."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "These are settings you control. Keep the menu bar icon on until you know how to reopen Settings, and restore the native Dock from Placement & Hiding if needed."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ce sont des paramètres que vous contrôlez. Gardez l'icône de la barre des menus activée jusqu'à savoir comment rouvrir les Paramètres, et restaurez le Dock natif depuis Position et masquage si nécessaire."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "These are settings you control. Keep the menu bar icon on until you know how to reopen Settings, and restore the native Dock from Placement & Hiding if needed."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ezeket a beállításokat Ön irányítja. Hagyja bekapcsolva a menüsor ikonját, amíg nem tudja, hogyan nyithatja meg újra a Beállításokat, és szükség esetén állítsa vissza a natív Dockot az Elhelyezés és elrejtés részből."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "These are settings you control. Keep the menu bar icon on until you know how to reopen Settings, and restore the native Dock from Placement & Hiding if needed."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "これらは自分で管理できる設定です。設定を再度開く方法がわかるまでメニューバーアイコンをオンのままにし、必要に応じて「配置と非表示」から標準のDockを復元してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "These are settings you control. Keep the menu bar icon on until you know how to reopen Settings, and restore the native Dock from Placement & Hiding if needed."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "These are settings you control. Keep the menu bar icon on until you know how to reopen Settings, and restore the native Dock from Placement & Hiding if needed."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dit zijn instellingen die je zelf kunt aanpassen. Laat het pictogram in de menubalk staan totdat je weet hoe je de Instellingen opnieuw kunt openen, en zet indien nodig het standaard Dock van macOS weer terug via 'Plaatsing en verbergen'."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Te ustawienia są pod Twoją kontrolą. Pozostaw ikonę na pasku menu włączoną, dopóki nie poznasz sposobu ponownego otwierania Ustawień. W razie potrzeby przywróć systemowy Dock w sekcji Położenie i ukrywanie."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Estas são definições que controla. Mantenha o ícone da barra de menus ativo até saber como reabrir as Definições e, se necessário, restaure a Dock nativa em Posicionamento e Ocultação."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "These are settings you control. Keep the menu bar icon on until you know how to reopen Settings, and restore the native Dock from Placement & Hiding if needed."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "These are settings you control. Keep the menu bar icon on until you know how to reopen Settings, and restore the native Dock from Placement & Hiding if needed."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Эти параметры задаете вы. Оставьте отображение значка в строке меню включенным, пока не разберетесь, как снова открыть настройки. При необходимости восстановите системный Dock в разделе «Расположение и скрытие»."
          }
        },
        "sr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "These are settings you control. Keep the menu bar icon on until you know how to reopen Settings, and restore the native Dock from Placement & Hiding if needed."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Det här är inställningar som du styr över. Behåll menyradssymbolen tills du vet hur du öppnar Inställningar igen, och återställ den inbyggda Docken från Placering och gömning om det behövs."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bunlar senin denetlediğin ayarlardır. Ayarlar'ı nasıl yeniden açacağını öğrenene kadar menü çubuğu simgesini açık tut ve gerekirse yerel Dock'u Yerleşim & Gizleme bölümünden geri yükle."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "These are settings you control. Keep the menu bar icon on until you know how to reopen Settings, and restore the native Dock from Placement & Hiding if needed."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Đây là những cài đặt do bạn kiểm soát. Hãy giữ biểu tượng thanh menu luôn bật cho đến khi bạn biết cách mở lại phần Cài đặt, và khôi phục Dock gốc từ mục Vị trí & Ẩn nếu cần thiết."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些设置都可以由你自行调整。在熟悉如何重新打开“设置”之前，建议保留菜单栏图标；如有需要，可在“位置与隐藏”中恢复原生 Dock。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這些設定由您自行控制。在確認知道如何重新開啟「設定」之前，請保留選單列圖示。如有需要，可在「位置與隱藏」中還原原生 Dock。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
