            "value" : "此小组件需要较新版本的 DockDoor Pro。请更新应用以安装此小组件。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此小工具需要較新版本的 DockDoor Pro。請更新應用程式以安裝此小工具。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This will restart the Dock process, expect your computer to flash briefly. *NOTE*: The native dock may not restore if the DockDoor Pro process is force-quit or crashes, which may leave the native dock disabled." : {
      "comment" : "Settings control title",
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This will restart the Dock process, expect your computer to flash briefly. *NOTE*: The native dock may not restore if the DockDoor Pro process is force-quit or crashes, which may leave the native dock disabled."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "سيؤدي هذا إلى إعادة تشغيل عملية Dock، وتوقع وميضًا قصيرًا على الشاشة. *ملاحظة*: قد لا يُستعاد شريط Dock الأصلي إذا أُنهي DockDoor Pro قسرًا أو تعطل، مما قد يترك Dock الأصلي معطلًا."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This will restart the Dock process, expect your computer to flash briefly. *NOTE*: The native dock may not restore if the DockDoor Pro process is force-quit or crashes, which may leave the native dock disabled."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This will restart the Dock process, expect your computer to flash briefly. *NOTE*: The native dock may not restore if the DockDoor Pro process is force-quit or crashes, which may leave the native dock disabled."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This will restart the Dock process, expect your computer to flash briefly. *NOTE*: The native dock may not restore if the DockDoor Pro process is force-quit or crashes, which may leave the native dock disabled."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dies startet den Dock-Prozess neu; der Bildschirm kann kurz flackern. *HINWEIS*: Das native Dock wird möglicherweise nicht wiederhergestellt, wenn der DockDoor Pro-Prozess per „Sofort beenden“ beendet wird oder abstürzt. Dadurch kann das native Dock deaktiviert bleiben."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This will restart the Dock process, expect your computer to flash briefly. *NOTE*: The native dock may not restore if the DockDoor Pro process is force-quit or crashes, which may leave the native dock disabled."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esto reiniciará el proceso del Dock; espera un breve parpadeo en tu ordenador. *NOTA*: puede que el Dock nativo no se restaure si el proceso de DockDoor Pro se fuerza a salir o falla, lo que puede dejar el Dock nativo desactivado."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This will restart the Dock process, expect your computer to flash briefly. *NOTE*: The native dock may not restore if the DockDoor Pro process is force-quit or crashes, which may leave the native dock disabled."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cela redémarrera le processus Dock, attendez-vous à un bref clignotement de l'écran. *REMARQUE* : le Dock natif peut ne pas être restauré si le processus DockDoor Pro est forcé à quitter ou plante, ce qui peut laisser le Dock natif désactivé."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This will restart the Dock process, expect your computer to flash briefly. *NOTE*: The native dock may not restore if the DockDoor Pro process is force-quit or crashes, which may leave the native dock disabled."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ez újraindítja a Dock folyamatot, a számítógép képernyője rövid időre felvillanhat. *MEGJEGYZÉS*: Előfordulhat, hogy a natív Dock nem áll vissza, ha a DockDoor Pro folyamatot kilépésre kényszerítik, vagy összeomlik, így a natív Dock letiltva maradhat."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This will restart the Dock process, expect your computer to flash briefly. *NOTE*: The native dock may not restore if the DockDoor Pro process is force-quit or crashes, which may leave the native dock disabled."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dockプロセスを再起動します。画面が一瞬ちらつくことがあります。*注意*: DockDoor Proのプロセスが強制終了された場合やクラッシュした場合、標準のDockが復元されず、無効のままになることがあります。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This will restart the Dock process, expect your computer to flash briefly. *NOTE*: The native dock may not restore if the DockDoor Pro process is force-quit or crashes, which may leave the native dock disabled."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This will restart the Dock process, expect your computer to flash briefly. *NOTE*: The native dock may not restore if the DockDoor Pro process is force-quit or crashes, which may leave the native dock disabled."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hierdoor wordt het Dock-proces opnieuw gestart. Het beeld kan daarbij kort knipperen. *LET OP*: Het standaard Dock van macOS wordt mogelijk niet hersteld als het DockDoor Pro-proces geforceerd wordt afgesloten of crasht, waardoor het standaard Dock van macOS mogelijk uitgeschakeld blijft."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spowoduje to ponowne uruchomienie procesu Dock; obraz może na chwilę mignąć. *UWAGA*: systemowy Dock może nie zostać przywrócony po wymuszeniu zakończenia DockDoor Pro lub awarii aplikacji, przez co może pozostać wyłączony."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Isto reiniciará o processo da Dock; o ecrã do computador pode piscar brevemente. *NOTA*: A Dock nativa pode não ser restaurada se o processo do DockDoor Pro for forçado a sair ou falhar, o que pode deixar a Dock nativa desativada."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This will restart the Dock process, expect your computer to flash briefly. *NOTE*: The native dock may not restore if the DockDoor Pro process is force-quit or crashes, which may leave the native dock disabled."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This will restart the Dock process, expect your computer to flash briefly. *NOTE*: The native dock may not restore if the DockDoor Pro process is force-quit or crashes, which may leave the native dock disabled."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Процесс Dock будет перезапущен, поэтому экран компьютера может ненадолго мигнуть. *ПРИМЕЧАНИЕ*: системный Dock может не восстановиться после принудительного завершения или сбоя DockDoor Pro. В результате он может остаться отключенным."
          }
        },
        "sr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This will restart the Dock process, expect your computer to flash briefly. *NOTE*: The native dock may not restore if the DockDoor Pro process is force-quit or crashes, which may leave the native dock disabled."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Det här startar om Dock-processen, räkna med att skärmen blinkar till kort. *OBS*: Den inbyggda Docken kanske inte återställs om DockDoor Pro-processen tvångsavslutas eller kraschar, vilket kan lämna den inbyggda Docken avstängd."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bu, Dock sürecini yeniden başlatır, bilgisayarının kısa süre yanıp sönmesini bekle. *NOT*: DockDoor Pro süreci zorla kapatılırsa veya çökerse yerel dock geri yüklenmeyebilir, bu da yerel dock'u devre dışı bırakabilir."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This will restart the Dock process, expect your computer to flash briefly. *NOTE*: The native dock may not restore if the DockDoor Pro process is force-quit or crashes, which may leave the native dock disabled."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Thao tác này sẽ khởi động lại tiến trình Dock, màn hình máy tính của bạn có thể nháy sáng trong chốc lát. *LƯU Ý*: Dock gốc có thể không tự khôi phục nếu tiến trình DockDoor Pro bị buộc thoát hoặc gặp sự cố, điều này có thể khiến Dock gốc của hệ thống bị vô hiệu hóa."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此操作将重新启动 Dock 进程，屏幕可能会短暂闪烁。*注意*：如果 DockDoor Pro 进程被强制退出或崩溃，原生 Dock 可能无法恢复，并保持停用状态。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這將會重新啟動 Dock 行程，您的電腦畫面可能會短暫閃爍。*注意*：如果 DockDoor Pro 行程被強制結束或意外當機，原生 Dock 可能無法還原，這可能會導致原生 Dock 處於停用狀態。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
