    "Turn on AppSense, then link a profile to an app. While that app is focused, DockDoor Pro can apply that profile across displays, overriding per-display assignments until you switch away." : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding profile switching workflow description",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turn on AppSense, then link a profile to an app. While that app is focused, DockDoor Pro can apply that profile across displays, overriding per-display assignments until you switch away."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "فعّل AppSense ثم اربط ملف تعريف بتطبيق. أثناء تركيز ذلك التطبيق، يمكن لـ DockDoor Pro تطبيق ملف التعريف ذلك على كل الشاشات، متجاوزًا تعيينات كل شاشة حتى تنتقل بعيدًا عنه."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turn on AppSense, then link a profile to an app. While that app is focused, DockDoor Pro can apply that profile across displays, overriding per-display assignments until you switch away."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turn on AppSense, then link a profile to an app. While that app is focused, DockDoor Pro can apply that profile across displays, overriding per-display assignments until you switch away."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turn on AppSense, then link a profile to an app. While that app is focused, DockDoor Pro can apply that profile across displays, overriding per-display assignments until you switch away."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aktivieren Sie AppSense und verknüpfen Sie dann ein Profil mit einer App. Solange diese App aktiv ist, kann DockDoor Pro dieses Profil auf allen Displays anwenden und die Zuordnungen pro Display überschreiben, bis Sie zu einer anderen App wechseln."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turn on AppSense, then link a profile to an app. While that app is focused, DockDoor Pro can apply that profile across displays, overriding per-display assignments until you switch away."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Activa AppSense y luego vincula un perfil a una app. Mientras esa app esté en primer plano, DockDoor Pro puede aplicar ese perfil en todas las pantallas, anulando las asignaciones por pantalla hasta que cambies a otra app."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turn on AppSense, then link a profile to an app. While that app is focused, DockDoor Pro can apply that profile across displays, overriding per-display assignments until you switch away."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Activez AppSense, puis liez un profil à une app. Tant que cette app est au premier plan, DockDoor Pro peut appliquer ce profil sur tous les écrans, en remplaçant les attributions par écran jusqu'à ce que vous changiez d'app."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turn on AppSense, then link a profile to an app. While that app is focused, DockDoor Pro can apply that profile across displays, overriding per-display assignments until you switch away."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kapcsolja be az AppSense funkciót, majd kapcsoljon össze egy profilt egy appal. Amíg az adott app van fókuszban, a DockDoor Pro minden kijelzőn alkalmazhatja azt a profilt, felülbírálva a kijelzőnkénti hozzárendeléseket, amíg el nem vált róla."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turn on AppSense, then link a profile to an app. While that app is focused, DockDoor Pro can apply that profile across displays, overriding per-display assignments until you switch away."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AppSenseをオンにしてから、プロファイルをアプリにリンクします。そのアプリにフォーカスがある間、DockDoor Proはディスプレイごとの割り当てを上書きして、そのプロファイルをすべてのディスプレイに適用できます。別のアプリに切り替えると元に戻ります。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turn on AppSense, then link a profile to an app. While that app is focused, DockDoor Pro can apply that profile across displays, overriding per-display assignments until you switch away."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turn on AppSense, then link a profile to an app. While that app is focused, DockDoor Pro can apply that profile across displays, overriding per-display assignments until you switch away."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Schakel AppSense in en koppel vervolgens een profiel aan een app. Zolang die app actief is, kan DockDoor Pro dat profiel op alle beeldschermen toepassen, waarbij de instellingen per beeldscherm worden overschreven, totdat je naar een andere app overschakelt."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Włącz AppSense, a następnie powiąż profil z aplikacją. Gdy aplikacja jest aktywna, DockDoor Pro może zastosować ten profil na wszystkich wyświetlaczach, zastępując ich osobne przypisania do czasu przełączenia na inną aplikację."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ative o AppSense e, depois, associe um perfil a uma app. Enquanto essa app estiver em foco, o DockDoor Pro pode aplicar esse perfil em todos os ecrãs, substituindo as atribuições por ecrã até mudar para outra app."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turn on AppSense, then link a profile to an app. While that app is focused, DockDoor Pro can apply that profile across displays, overriding per-display assignments until you switch away."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turn on AppSense, then link a profile to an app. While that app is focused, DockDoor Pro can apply that profile across displays, overriding per-display assignments until you switch away."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Включите AppSense, затем свяжите профиль с приложением. Пока это приложение находится на переднем плане, DockDoor Pro может применять связанный профиль на всех дисплеях, временно переопределяя назначения для отдельных дисплеев. После перехода к другому приложению прежние назначения снова начнут действовать."
          }
        },
        "sr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turn on AppSense, then link a profile to an app. While that app is focused, DockDoor Pro can apply that profile across displays, overriding per-display assignments until you switch away."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Slå på AppSense och länka sedan en profil till en app. Medan appen är i fokus kan DockDoor Pro använda den profilen på alla skärmar och åsidosätta tilldelningar per skärm tills du växlar bort."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AppSense'i aç, ardından bir profili bir uygulamaya bağla. O uygulama odaktayken DockDoor Pro, sen başka yere geçene kadar ekran başına atamaları geçersiz kılarak o profili ekranlar genelinde uygulayabilir."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turn on AppSense, then link a profile to an app. While that app is focused, DockDoor Pro can apply that profile across displays, overriding per-display assignments until you switch away."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bật AppSense, sau đó liên kết một hồ sơ với một ứng dụng. Khi ứng dụng đó được đặt tiêu điểm, DockDoor Pro có thể áp dụng hồ sơ đó trên các màn hình, ghi đè các thiết lập riêng cho từng màn hình cho đến khi bạn chuyển sang ứng dụng khác."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "启用 AppSense，然后将配置文件关联到一个应用。当该应用获得焦点时，DockDoor Pro 会在所有显示器上应用该配置文件，并在切换到其他应用之前覆盖按显示器分配的配置。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "啟用 AppSense，然後將設定檔連結至應用程式。當該應用程式取得焦點時，DockDoor Pro 會在所有顯示器上套用該設定檔，並暫時覆蓋各顯示器的個別指派設定，直到您切換至其他應用程式為止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
