    "Turn the dock on or off per display, and give each its own edge and profile. \"Use Global\" follows the orientation above; \"Active Profile\" follows whichever profile you switch to." : {
      "comment" : "Per-display configuration note",
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turn the dock on or off per display, and give each its own edge and profile. \"Use Global\" follows the orientation above; \"Active Profile\" follows whichever profile you switch to."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "شغّل Dock أو أوقفه لكل شاشة، وامنح كل شاشة حافتها وملف تعريفها الخاصين بها. يتبع خيار «استخدام الإعداد العام» الاتجاه المحدد أعلاه؛ بينما يتبع «ملف التعريف النشط» أي ملف تعريف تبدّل إليه."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turn the dock on or off per display, and give each its own edge and profile. \"Use Global\" follows the orientation above; \"Active Profile\" follows whichever profile you switch to."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turn the dock on or off per display, and give each its own edge and profile. \"Use Global\" follows the orientation above; \"Active Profile\" follows whichever profile you switch to."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turn the dock on or off per display, and give each its own edge and profile. \"Use Global\" follows the orientation above; \"Active Profile\" follows whichever profile you switch to."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Schalten Sie das Dock pro Display ein oder aus und weisen Sie jedem Display eine eigene Bildschirmkante und ein eigenes Profil zu. \"Global verwenden\" übernimmt die obige Ausrichtung; \"Aktives Profil\" folgt dem Profil, zu dem Sie wechseln."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turn the dock on or off per display, and give each its own edge and profile. \"Use Global\" follows the orientation above; \"Active Profile\" follows whichever profile you switch to."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Activa o desactiva el Dock por pantalla y asigna a cada una su propio borde y perfil. \"Usar global\" sigue la orientación de arriba; \"Perfil activo\" sigue el perfil al que cambies."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turn the dock on or off per display, and give each its own edge and profile. \"Use Global\" follows the orientation above; \"Active Profile\" follows whichever profile you switch to."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Activez ou désactivez le Dock par écran, et donnez à chacun son propre bord et son propre profil. « Utiliser le réglage global » suit l'orientation ci-dessus ; « Profil actif » suit le profil vers lequel vous basculez."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turn the dock on or off per display, and give each its own edge and profile. \"Use Global\" follows the orientation above; \"Active Profile\" follows whichever profile you switch to."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kapcsolja be vagy ki a Dockot kijelzőnként, és adjon mindegyiknek saját élt és profilt. A „Globális használata” a fenti tájolást követi; az „Aktív profil” azt a profilt követi, amelyikre éppen vált."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turn the dock on or off per display, and give each its own edge and profile. \"Use Global\" follows the orientation above; \"Active Profile\" follows whichever profile you switch to."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ディスプレイごとにDockのオン/オフを切り替え、それぞれに専用の配置エッジとプロファイルを設定できます。「グローバルを使用」は上の方向設定に従い、「アクティブなプロファイル」は切り替えたプロファイルに従います。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turn the dock on or off per display, and give each its own edge and profile. \"Use Global\" follows the orientation above; \"Active Profile\" follows whichever profile you switch to."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turn the dock on or off per display, and give each its own edge and profile. \"Use Global\" follows the orientation above; \"Active Profile\" follows whichever profile you switch to."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Schakel het Dock per scherm in of uit en stel voor elk scherm een eigen rand en profiel in. Bij \"Gebruik globaal\" wordt de hierboven gekozen oriëntatie gevolgd; bij \"Actief profiel\" wordt het profiel gevolgd waarnaar je overschakelt."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Włącz lub wyłącz Dock osobno dla każdego wyświetlacza oraz przypisz mu własną krawędź i profil. Opcja „Domyślne” używa orientacji wybranej powyżej, a opcja „Aktywny profil” używa aktualnie wybranego profilu."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ative ou desative a Dock por ecrã e atribua a cada um a sua própria extremidade e perfil. \"Usar global\" segue a orientação acima; \"Perfil ativo\" segue o perfil para o qual mudar."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turn the dock on or off per display, and give each its own edge and profile. \"Use Global\" follows the orientation above; \"Active Profile\" follows whichever profile you switch to."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turn the dock on or off per display, and give each its own edge and profile. \"Use Global\" follows the orientation above; \"Active Profile\" follows whichever profile you switch to."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Включайте или выключайте Dock отдельно на каждом дисплее и назначайте каждому свое положение у края экрана и профиль. Вариант «Использовать глобальные настройки» учитывает ориентацию, указанную выше, а «Активный профиль» следует за выбранным в данный момент профилем."
          }
        },
        "sr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turn the dock on or off per display, and give each its own edge and profile. \"Use Global\" follows the orientation above; \"Active Profile\" follows whichever profile you switch to."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Slå på eller av dockan per skärm och ge varje skärm sin egen kant och profil. \"Använd global\" följer riktningen ovan; \"Aktiv profil\" följer den profil du växlar till."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dock'u ekran başına aç veya kapat ve her birine kendi kenarını ve profilini ver. \"Genel ayarlar kullanılsın\" yukarıdaki yönü izler; \"Aktif Profil\" hangi profile geçersen onu izler."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turn the dock on or off per display, and give each its own edge and profile. \"Use Global\" follows the orientation above; \"Active Profile\" follows whichever profile you switch to."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bật hoặc tắt dock cho từng màn hình, đồng thời cung cấp cho mỗi màn hình cạnh và hồ sơ riêng biệt. \"Sử dụng toàn cục\" tuân theo hướng ở trên; \"Hồ sơ đang hoạt động\" tuân theo bất kỳ hồ sơ nào mà bạn chuyển sang."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "为每台显示器单独开启或关闭 Dock，并设置各自的停靠边缘和配置文件。“使用全局设置”采用上方的方向设置；“当前配置文件”跟随你切换到的配置文件。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可針對各顯示器分別啟用或停用 Dock，並為其設定專屬的停靠邊緣與設定檔。「使用全域設定」會依照上方的方向設定；「使用中的設定檔」則會跟隨您切換的設定檔。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
