    "With ⌘ held, the Cycle Windows key steps through the highlighted app's windows. Once a window is selected, the Preview Navigator action keys (Q, M, F by default) act on it. Until then ⌘Q, ⌘H and the other native switcher keys work as usual." : {
      "comment" : "Glance keyboard note",
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "With ⌘ held, the Cycle Windows key steps through the highlighted app's windows. Once a window is selected, the Preview Navigator action keys (Q, M, F by default) act on it. Until then ⌘Q, ⌘H and the other native switcher keys work as usual."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "مع الضغط باستمرار على ⌘، ينتقل مفتاح «تدوير النوافذ» بين نوافذ التطبيق المميز. بمجرد تحديد نافذة، تعمل عليها مفاتيح إجراءات «مستعرض المعاينات» (Q وM وF افتراضيًا). وحتى ذلك الحين، تعمل ⌘Q و⌘H ومفاتيح المبدّل الأصلي الأخرى كالمعتاد."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "With ⌘ held, the Cycle Windows key steps through the highlighted app's windows. Once a window is selected, the Preview Navigator action keys (Q, M, F by default) act on it. Until then ⌘Q, ⌘H and the other native switcher keys work as usual."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "With ⌘ held, the Cycle Windows key steps through the highlighted app's windows. Once a window is selected, the Preview Navigator action keys (Q, M, F by default) act on it. Until then ⌘Q, ⌘H and the other native switcher keys work as usual."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "With ⌘ held, the Cycle Windows key steps through the highlighted app's windows. Once a window is selected, the Preview Navigator action keys (Q, M, F by default) act on it. Until then ⌘Q, ⌘H and the other native switcher keys work as usual."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bei gedrückter ⌘-Taste blättert die Taste zum Wechseln zwischen Fenstern durch die Fenster der hervorgehobenen App. Sobald ein Fenster ausgewählt ist, wirken die Aktionstasten des Vorschau-Navigators (standardmäßig Q, M, F) darauf. Bis dahin funktionieren ⌘Q, ⌘H und die anderen nativen Wechslertasten wie gewohnt."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "With ⌘ held, the Cycle Windows key steps through the highlighted app's windows. Once a window is selected, the Preview Navigator action keys (Q, M, F by default) act on it. Until then ⌘Q, ⌘H and the other native switcher keys work as usual."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Con ⌘ pulsada, la tecla Alternar ventanas recorre las ventanas de la app resaltada. Una vez seleccionada una ventana, las teclas de acción del Navegador de previsualizaciones (Q, M, F por omisión) actúan sobre ella. Hasta entonces, ⌘Q, ⌘H y las demás teclas del selector nativo funcionan como siempre."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "With ⌘ held, the Cycle Windows key steps through the highlighted app's windows. Once a window is selected, the Preview Navigator action keys (Q, M, F by default) act on it. Until then ⌘Q, ⌘H and the other native switcher keys work as usual."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En maintenant ⌘, la touche Parcourir les fenêtres passe d'une fenêtre à l'autre de l'app en surbrillance. Une fois une fenêtre sélectionnée, les touches d'action du navigateur d'aperçus (Q, M, F par défaut) agissent sur elle. D'ici là, ⌘Q, ⌘H et les autres touches du sélecteur natif fonctionnent comme d'habitude."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "With ⌘ held, the Cycle Windows key steps through the highlighted app's windows. Once a window is selected, the Preview Navigator action keys (Q, M, F by default) act on it. Until then ⌘Q, ⌘H and the other native switcher keys work as usual."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A ⌘ lenyomva tartásakor az Ablakok váltása billentyű végiglépked a kiemelt app ablakain. Egy ablak kijelölése után az Előnézet navigátor műveletbillentyűi (alapértelmezés szerint Q, M, F) azon hajtódnak végre. Addig a ⌘Q, a ⌘H és a többi natív váltóbillentyű a szokásos módon működik."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "With ⌘ held, the Cycle Windows key steps through the highlighted app's windows. Once a window is selected, the Preview Navigator action keys (Q, M, F by default) act on it. Until then ⌘Q, ⌘H and the other native switcher keys work as usual."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "⌘キーを押したまま「ウインドウを切り替え」キーを押すと、ハイライトされたアプリのウインドウを順に切り替えます。ウインドウを選択すると、プレビューナビゲータのアクションキー（デフォルトではQ、M、F）がそのウインドウに作用します。それまでは、⌘Q、⌘Hなどの標準のスイッチャーキーが通常どおり機能します。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "With ⌘ held, the Cycle Windows key steps through the highlighted app's windows. Once a window is selected, the Preview Navigator action keys (Q, M, F by default) act on it. Until then ⌘Q, ⌘H and the other native switcher keys work as usual."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "With ⌘ held, the Cycle Windows key steps through the highlighted app's windows. Once a window is selected, the Preview Navigator action keys (Q, M, F by default) act on it. Until then ⌘Q, ⌘H and the other native switcher keys work as usual."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Als je ⌘ ingedrukt houdt, blader je met de toets ‘Door vensters bladeren’ door de vensters van de geselecteerde app. Zodra een venster is geselecteerd, werken de actietoetsen van de ‘Voorbeeldnavigator’ (standaard Q, M en F) daarop. Voor die tijd werken ⌘Q, ⌘H en de andere standaard wisselaartoetsen zoals gewoonlijk."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Przytrzymując ⌘, użyj klawisza Przełączaj okna, aby przechodzić między oknami wyróżnionej aplikacji. Po wybraniu okna działają na nim klawisze akcji Nawigatora podglądu (domyślnie Q, M i F). Do tego czasu ⌘Q, ⌘H i pozostałe natywne klawisze przełącznika działają jak zwykle."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Com ⌘ premida, a tecla Percorrer Janelas percorre as janelas da app realçada. Assim que uma janela estiver selecionada, as teclas de ação do Navegador de pré-visualizações (Q, M e F por predefinição) atuam sobre ela. Até lá, ⌘Q, ⌘H e as outras teclas nativas do alternador funcionam normalmente."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "With ⌘ held, the Cycle Windows key steps through the highlighted app's windows. Once a window is selected, the Preview Navigator action keys (Q, M, F by default) act on it. Until then ⌘Q, ⌘H and the other native switcher keys work as usual."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "With ⌘ held, the Cycle Windows key steps through the highlighted app's windows. Once a window is selected, the Preview Navigator action keys (Q, M, F by default) act on it. Until then ⌘Q, ⌘H and the other native switcher keys work as usual."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Если удерживать ⌘, клавиша «Перебор окон» переключает окна выделенного приложения. Когда окно выбрано, к нему применяются клавиши действий навигатора предпросмотра (по умолчанию Q, M, F). До этого ⌘Q, ⌘H и другие клавиши системного переключателя работают как обычно."
          }
        },
        "sr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "With ⌘ held, the Cycle Windows key steps through the highlighted app's windows. Once a window is selected, the Preview Navigator action keys (Q, M, F by default) act on it. Until then ⌘Q, ⌘H and the other native switcher keys work as usual."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "När du håller ned ⌘ stegar tangenten för Växla fönster igenom den markerade appens fönster. När ett fönster är valt agerar åtgärdstangenterna i Förhandsvisningsnavigator (Q, M, F som standard) på det. Tills dess fungerar ⌘Q, ⌘H och systemväxlarens övriga tangenter som vanligt."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "⌘ basılıyken, Pencereleri Döngüle tuşu vurgulanan uygulamanın pencereleri arasında gezinir. Bir pencere seçildiğinde, Önizleme Gezgini eylem tuşları (varsayılan olarak Q, M, F) onun üzerinde işlem yapar. O zamana kadar ⌘Q, ⌘H ve diğer yerel değiştirici tuşlar her zamanki gibi çalışır."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "With ⌘ held, the Cycle Windows key steps through the highlighted app's windows. Once a window is selected, the Preview Navigator action keys (Q, M, F by default) act on it. Until then ⌘Q, ⌘H and the other native switcher keys work as usual."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Khi giữ ⌘, phím Chuyển đổi cửa sổ sẽ lần lượt đi qua các cửa sổ của ứng dụng đang được tô sáng. Khi một cửa sổ đã được chọn, các phím tác vụ của Trình điều hướng xem trước (mặc định là Q, M, F) sẽ tác động lên cửa sổ đó. Trước lúc đó, ⌘Q, ⌘H và các phím khác của bộ chuyển đổi mặc định vẫn hoạt động như bình thường."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按住 ⌘ 时，“窗口切换键”可逐个切换高亮应用的窗口。选中窗口后，“预览导航器”的操作键（默认为 Q、M、F）将作用于该窗口。选中窗口前，⌘Q、⌘H 等原生切换器快捷键照常工作。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按住 ⌘ 時，按下「循環切換視窗」鍵可逐一切換目前反白應用程式的視窗。選取視窗後，「預覽導覽器」的操作鍵（預設為 Q、M、F）會套用至該視窗。在選取視窗之前，⌘Q、⌘H 及其他系統原生切換器快速鍵仍會照常運作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With the menu bar icon off, you can still reopen Settings from the dock's profile or settings button — or by relaunching DockDoor Pro from Finder, Spotlight, or Launchpad." : {
      "comment" : "Settings note explaining how to reopen settings when the menu bar icon is hidden",
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "With the menu bar icon off, you can still reopen Settings from the dock's profile or settings button — or by relaunching DockDoor Pro from Finder, Spotlight, or Launchpad."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "مع إيقاف أيقونة شريط القائمة، لا يزال بإمكانك إعادة فتح الإعدادات من زر ملف التعريف أو زر الإعدادات في Dock، أو بإعادة تشغيل DockDoor Pro من Finder أو Spotlight أو Launchpad."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "With the menu bar icon off, you can still reopen Settings from the dock's profile or settings button — or by relaunching DockDoor Pro from Finder, Spotlight, or Launchpad."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "With the menu bar icon off, you can still reopen Settings from the dock's profile or settings button — or by relaunching DockDoor Pro from Finder, Spotlight, or Launchpad."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "With the menu bar icon off, you can still reopen Settings from the dock's profile or settings button — or by relaunching DockDoor Pro from Finder, Spotlight, or Launchpad."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn das Menüleistensymbol deaktiviert ist, können Sie die Einstellungen weiterhin über die Profil- oder Einstellungsschaltfläche im Dock öffnen – oder indem Sie DockDoor Pro über Finder, Spotlight oder Launchpad erneut starten."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "With the menu bar icon off, you can still reopen Settings from the dock's profile or settings button — or by relaunching DockDoor Pro from Finder, Spotlight, or Launchpad."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Con el icono de la barra de menús desactivado, aún puedes reabrir Ajustes desde el botón de perfil o de ajustes del Dock, o volviendo a abrir DockDoor Pro desde el Finder, Spotlight o Launchpad."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "With the menu bar icon off, you can still reopen Settings from the dock's profile or settings button — or by relaunching DockDoor Pro from Finder, Spotlight, or Launchpad."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Avec l'icône de la barre des menus désactivée, vous pouvez toujours rouvrir les Paramètres depuis le bouton de profil ou de paramètres du Dock, ou en relançant DockDoor Pro depuis le Finder, Spotlight ou Launchpad."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "With the menu bar icon off, you can still reopen Settings from the dock's profile or settings button — or by relaunching DockDoor Pro from Finder, Spotlight, or Launchpad."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ha a menüsor ikonja ki van kapcsolva, a Beállításokat továbbra is megnyithatja a Dock profil- vagy beállítások gombjával, vagy a DockDoor Pro újraindításával a Finderből, a Spotlightból vagy a Launchpadből."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "With the menu bar icon off, you can still reopen Settings from the dock's profile or settings button — or by relaunching DockDoor Pro from Finder, Spotlight, or Launchpad."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
